"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/d878fe6e36d6c5ed3aba2e3c204f945e9af47560","sha":"d878fe6e36d6c5ed3aba2e3c204f945e9af47560","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/d878fe6e36d6c5ed3aba2e3c204f945e9af47560"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/1b468234b63684510b7a8a410876a4f32345e5d1","sha":"1b468234b63684510b7a8a410876a4f32345e5d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/1b468234b63684510b7a8a410876a4f32345e5d1"}],"sha":"764ca10b920f427801d362c538a91e01fe56d64e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/764ca10b920f427801d362c538a91e01fe56d64e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/d878fe6e36d6c5ed3aba2e3c204f945e9af47560/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:06:25Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:06:25Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"fix(ai-agent): 修意图路由静默兜底到通用助手\n\n现象：小程序主对话「先完成，再完美 英语怎么说」被判成 general（翻译助手不生效）。\n日志只有一行 `意图路由: auto → general (via=fallback conf=0.3)`，无任何报错。\n\n四个缺陷叠加，任一都足以造成兜底：\n\n1. 关键词差一个字：translate.keywords 只有「英文怎么说」，覆盖不了「英语怎么说」\n   → 本该 0ms 规则命中的请求被推给 LLM 路径。\n2. 模型 id 前缀缺失：intent.service 默认 `deepseek-v4-flash`，而 ClientRegistry\n   注册键是 `deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash` → getOrFallback 静默回退 hy3，不报错。\n   同样问题存在于 deploy / general / web-system-dev 三个 agent 定义。\n3. 致命项：分类调用 maxTokens=60，而 DeepSeek 系默认注入 1024 思考预算\n   → 60 个 token 全被 reasoning 吃光，返回 finish_reason=length + content=''''\n   → JSON 解析必然失败 → 100% 兜底。实测 3/3 空返回。\n4. 放大项：INTENT_TIMEOUT_MS=1200，比实测最快 1.3s 还短。\n\n改动：\n- agent-core: ChatOptions 新增可选 thinking 字段 + 导出 ThinkingOption；\n  TokenHub/Hy3 客户端支持按调用覆盖（不传时与改造前 payload 逐字段一致，零影响）\n- intent-classifier: maxTokens 60→256 + 显式 thinking:{type:''disabled''}；\n  L3 失败/超时/空内容分支加 warn 留痕（原来静默 catch，是本次最难定位的原因）\n- intent.service: INTENT_MODEL 默认值改带前缀 id；超时默认 1200→3000\n- agent-def-sync: 新增 assertModelRegistered()，定义里的 model 未注册时打 error\n  （这类静默回退今后能在启动 30s 内暴露）\n- ai-service builtinSeeds: model 改带前缀 id；translate 关键词补齐 14 词\n- p34 迁移：修 agent_definitions 的 model 与 keywords（合并语义 + 事务 + 备份表）\n\n验证：agent-core 18 用例 + ai-agent 8 用例全绿；两边 tsc --noEmit EXIT=0；\nhy3 带 thinking:disabled 实测 finish_reason=stop / reasoning_tokens=0；\ndev 库 p34 已执行，translate.keywords=14 词、三个 model 已带前缀。\n\nContract: docs/reviews/contract-review-2026-10-08-intent-routing.md\nRelease: docs/reviews/release-review-2026-10-08-intent-routing.md","tree":{"sha":"247a5addcb91a328f3052e0cd75a4d26c8200d5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/247a5addcb91a328f3052e0cd75a4d26c8200d5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/d878fe6e36d6c5ed3aba2e3c204f945e9af47560","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://a