=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/901cd8b84da002cf53d5b84e3ebe9b420bd82e63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:36:07Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:36:34Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"docs(ops): 云联网方案暂缓，改走 A1（公网 IP 转 EIP + SSL 暂不开）\n\n决策变更：不再上云联网，改为仅把 dev 机公网 IP 转 EIP 固定住，\n云数据库公网 SSL 暂不开（云库仅含版本指针与部署配置，敏感度已评估可接受）。\n\nrunbook 顶部加「🔶 状态：暂缓」并把 A1 路线完整写入（控制台步骤/验证/不可逆说明），\n避免后人把本文误读为「待执行」。\n\n同时记录两个连带影响：\n1. 走公网就不要收紧 cloud-db.service.ts 的超时参数（现 10s/8s 是刻意放宽，\n   公网阻断时单次 connect 会挂 31s，靠应用层硬超时压到 9s）——收紧会误判故障\n2. SSL 证书 SAN 绑定外网地址，若日后改内网必须重配 = 再重启一次云库实例，\n   所以顺序必须是先改内网、后定 SSL\n\n仅文档，无代码变更。","tree":{"sha":"a775e72a408bb2b0c8312b1006a94d642a08ba8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/a775e72a408bb2b0c8312b1006a94d642a08ba8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/901cd8b84da002cf53d5b84e3ebe9b420bd82e63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/