ttps://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/84667dee8041ed804fa5c7d4ffec9270ab594549/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:11:15Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:11:15Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"docs(architecture): 新建系统平台架构与部署总览，标注过时文档\n\n## 背景\n现网/代码已迭代多代（6000 系端口、12 个服务、NEW 域指针表、云库双数据源），\n但入口文档还停在 2026-08/09 口径，其中 DEPLOYMENT.md 与 kedou-network-architecture.md\n已与事实严重背离，参照它们会直接得出错误结论。\n\n## 新增\n- docs/architecture/system-overview.md：15 章现状总览\n  仓库组成 / 技术栈 / 12 服务+三环境端口矩阵 / 前端与微前端 / 共享包 /\n  数据层（含 deploy-console 双数据源）/ 版本指针双域模型 / 三条发布通道 /\n  环境拓扑与静态根 / 配置与密钥 / CI / 脚本索引 / 技术债 / 文档索引\n- docs/operations/ccn-migration-runbook.md：跨地域云联网迁移 runbook\n  含已完成的网段预检（南京 10.206.16.0/20 vs 广州 172.16.16.0/20 无重叠）、\n  控制台逐步操作、切换/回滚、以及与 SSL 的决策顺序说明\n\n## 标注（不删除，保留历史脉络）\n- DEPLOYMENT.md → ❌ 废弃（3000 系端口、apps/admin-web 不存在、--update-env 反模式）\n- kedou-network-architecture.md → ❌ 废弃（pm2 写 6 个实际 12 个、无静态外置与云库分流）\n- release-system-design.md → ⚠️ 数据模型已过时（仍写 legacy 七表，实际已换 NEW 域）\n  这份最危险：修改日期最新但内容最旧，容易让人误信\n- README.md → 小幅校准（补 agent-message 包、端口表区分本机/dev-prod、指向总览）\n\n仅文档改动，无代码变更。","tree":{"sha":"1cb3d3d646eface04f743e3fe05dc883008ab8f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/1cb3d3d646eface04f743e3fe05dc883008ab8f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/84667dee8041ed804fa5c7d4ffec9270ab594549","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"co