i.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/a65aba6d5d49e6b755242352b82f4d2256d4df9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:06:10Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:06:10Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"fix(console): prod 指针写云库失败改用 HttpException 透出提示\n\n全局异常过滤器会把非 HttpException 的消息统一替换为「服务器内部错误」，\n运维看不到「prod 没生效」这个关键事实（与设计 §6「UI 明确提示」不符）。\n改用 ServiceUnavailableException 让提示透出。\n\n顺带修正探活端点注释：裸 /health 会被 serve-static 的 SPA 回退吃掉，\n实际路径是 /api/health/cloud-db。\n\nMicro-exempt: 异常类型与注释微调，无契约/发布面变更","tree":{"sha":"e80a7c5fb31031eb32667fb102fae06db5a47ec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/e80a7c5fb31031eb32667fb102fae06db5a47ec7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/a65aba6d5d49e6b755242352b82f4d2256d4df9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/a65aba6d5d49e6b755242352b82f4d2256d4df9b","node_id":"C_kwDORyTaTdoAKGE2NWFiYTZkNWQ0OWU2Yjc1NTI0MjM1MmI4MmY0ZDIyNTZkNGRmOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/ab46036d6151f5065ae0663e82959fe3ec890e43","sha":"ab46036d6151f5065ae0663e82959fe3ec890e43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/ab46036d6151f5065ae0663e82959fe3ec890e43"}],"sha":"a65aba6d5d49e6b755242352b82f4d2256d4df9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/a65aba6d5d49e6b755242352b82f4d2256d4df9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/ab46036d6151f5065ae0663e82959fe3ec890e43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:57:51Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:58:05Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"feat(console): 按环境分流数据源，prod 指针写云数据库（公网）\n\n根因：console 在 dev 机（南京 vpc-ljskd1kp），prod gateway 读广州云库，\ndev→云库内网跨地域+跨VPC 不通，prod 指针只能人工同步 → prod 发布「显示\n成功但线上没切」（2026-09-30 基座事故成因之一）。改走公网写云库。\n\n改动：\n- 新增 CloudDbModule：独立 DataSource（synchronize:false + entities:[]，\n  避免 DDL 变更生产表），懒连接、可重试、可一键关闭\n- 新增 EnvSplitWriterService：mirrorPointer / mirrorLegacyPointer / mirrorRows，\n  原生 SQL upsert；只有 prod 数据写云库，dev/local 留本地库\n- release-registry：本地写成功后镜像；本地失败不镜像\n- deploy.service：legacy 指针同样镜像（应急读取源，不阻断）\n- 新增 GET /health/cloud-db 探活（发布前预检，不回显主机地址）\n- .env.example 增 DEPLOY_CLOUD_DB_* 文档\n\n失败语义（P0）：env=prod 写云库失败必须抛出让任务 failed。\n原「失败只告警」在单库时代是止损，分流后是事故放大器：本地成功+云库失败\n= 流水线显示成功、prod 仍跑旧版本。legacy 镜像不阻断（非默认读取源）。\n\n回退：DEPLOY_CLOUD_DB_ENABLED=false 重启即回人工同步现状。\n\nRelease: docs/development/release-reviews/2026-10-08-console-env-datasource.md\nContract: pass（无对外契约变更；新增探活端点为只读健康检查）","tree":{"sha":"9cf1c234096b6c62d0c38bedc5af323d4e0551d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/9cf1c234096b6c62d0c38bedc5af323d4e0551d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/ab46036d6151f5065ae0663e82959fe3ec890e43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h