tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/b7c4a2ba5bb78c756dda1dd521f3b8166c750bb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:17:57Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T02:17:57Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"fix(deploy-console): 补注册变量门禁所需的两个实体（修复启动失败）\n\nPR #238 在 PipelineOrchestrationService 里新增了\n@InjectRepository(DeployPipelineVarEntity) 与 @InjectRepository(ConfigItemEntity)，\n但没在 PipelineOrchestrationModule 的 TypeOrmModule.forFeature 里注册 ——\nNest 启动时报 \"Nest can''t resolve dependencies of the PipelineOrchestrationService\n(DeployPipelineVarEntityRepository...)\"，dev 控制台起不来（6200 未监听、502）。\n\n⚠️ 教训：新增 @InjectRepository 必须同步在所属模块的 forFeature 注册实体。\n本地 jest 单测不构建 Nest DI 容器，抓不到这类错误；必须在发布后做一次\n进程启动 / 端口探活验证。","tree":{"sha":"27f05bfc7ed1e8eebd5a949f4a49c6c09c1aee4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/27f05bfc7ed1e8eebd5a949f4a49c6c09c1aee4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/b7c4a2ba5bb78c756dda1dd521f3b8166c750bb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url"