omment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:31:55Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"fix(intent): bianbian 关键词补高频绘画句式，修「帮我画一只…」路由不命中\n\n用户输入「帮我画一只在月球上骑车的橘猫，皮克斯风格」落在通用助手：旧关键词只有「画画/画一张/画个/生图…」，不含「画一只/帮我画」等高频句式 → 规则不命中走 LLM/兜底，且会话首轮锁定 general 后一直沿用。补 画一只/画一幅/帮我画/绘画/手绘/漫画/涂色/上色/皮克斯（confidence 0.9 ≥ 0.88，锁定态也可切走）。已同步 prod/dev agent_definitions（seed 覆盖面与 DB 一致）。","tree":{"sha":"553f3b76a2400dc85e306a29dcd92c02dc3d4b51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/553f3b76a2400dc85e306a29dcd92c02dc3d4b51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/248336d8552b412c58278967a635bec026a6b930","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/248336d8552b412c58278967a635bec026a6b930","node_id":"C_kwDORyTaTdoAKDI0ODMzNmQ4NTUyYjQxMmM1ODI3ODk2N2E2MzViZWMwMjZhNmI5MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/e98cbcbf9a0ad27f44027029f88cefa9c223727c","sha":"e98cbcbf9a0ad27f44027029f88cefa9c223727c","url"