"2026-09-28T14:27:07Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:31:54Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"fix(loader): 模块 CSS 就位后再 mount，消加载期 FOUC（巨大橙色 home 图标）\n\n根因：loader 注入模块 CSS link 后立即 mount，模块 CSS（byEnv 指针 + @import 两跳）未就位时无样式 DOM 先渲染。AppIcon 是无 width/height 的 svg，撑到浏览器默认 300x150、stroke=currentColor 继承品牌橙色，加载期闪现巨大橙色房子图标。\n\n修复：ensureCss 改为返回 Promise（onload/onerror/3s 超时三重兜底，不因 CSS 404 卡死挂载），mount 前 await；loadModule 里的提前注入保持并行下载不 await。AppIcon svg 补 width/height=16 内建尺寸作双保险（CSS 优先级高于属性，稳态取值不变）。已投 dev 并真浏览器验证。\n\nMicro-exempt: 缺陷修复——Teleport 浮层脱离模块容器致 scoped 样式失效（菜单竖排），非视觉改版，原型豁免台账已记\n\nMicro-exempt: 缺陷修复——CSS 未就位时 svg 无尺寸撑到 300x150 的加载闪烁，非视觉改版，原型豁免台账已记","tree":{"sha":"151bc4c7943ae4d61ed31d77eefb0c97635c2bea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/151bc4c7943ae4d61ed31d77eefb0c97635c2bea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/8aaaabbe66dfc22dcd3219a94d2908658ded7c55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/8aaaabbe66dfc22dcd3219a94d2908658ded7c55","node_id":"C_kwDORyTaTdoAKDhhYWFhYmJlNjZkZmMyMmRjZDMyMTlhOTRkMjkwODY1OGRlZDdjNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/fbc7c41441b260587e9f86b46a37194b8509b528","sha":"fbc7c41441b260587e9f86b46a37194b8509b528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/fbc7c41441b260587e9f86b46a37194b8509b528"}],"sha":"8aaaabbe66dfc22dcd3219a94d2908658ded7c55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/8aaaabbe66dfc22dcd3219a94d2908658ded7c55"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/fbc7c41441b260587e9f86b46a37194b8509b528/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T14:18:09Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:31:54Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"fix(mf): dropdown 浮层挂回模块容器，修 Teleport 导致 scoped 样式失效\n\n根因：mf 构建给模块 CSS 加 :where([data-module]) 前缀做样式隔离，antd Dropdown 浮层默认 Teleport 到 body，脱离模块容器后前缀匹配不上，浮层内模块 scoped 样式（.menu-row/.app-icon）全部失效，portal 顶栏用户菜单图标/文字竖排错乱。旧构建同样存在，属潜伏缺陷。\n\n修复：a-dropdown 加 :get-popup-container=\"(t) => t.parentNode\"，浮层渲染进触发器父节点（仍在模块容器内），一行恢复全部 scoped 样式。portal AppNavbar（用户报告）+ admin BasicLayout/UserList（同型隐患）。原型豁免记录见 apps/portal/prototype/index.html。\n\nMicro-exempt: 缺陷修复——Teleport 浮层脱离模块容器致 scoped 样式失效（菜单竖排），非视觉改版，原型豁免台账已记\n\nMicro-exempt: 缺陷修复——CSS 未就位时 svg 无尺寸撑到 300x150 的加载闪烁，非视觉改版，原型豁免台账已记","tree":{"sha":"78fb46e757bfb946c3503ff62d0b061289815e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/78fb46e757bfb946c3503ff62d0b061289815e7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/fbc7c41441b260587e9f86b46a37194b8509b528","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/fbc7c41441b260587e9f86b46a37194b8509b528","node_id":"C_kwDORyTaTdoAKGZiYzdjNDE0NDFiMjYwNTg3ZTlmODZiNDZhMzcxOTRiODUwOWI1Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/c728470f4cd2e4b7e384b4d349b7222ff17959ea","sha":"c728470f4cd2e4b7e384b4d349b7222ff17959ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/c728470f4cd2e4b7e384b4d349b7222ff17959ea"}],"sha":"fbc7c41441b260587e9f86b46a37194b8509b528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/fbc7c41441b260587e9f86b46a37194b8509b528"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/c728470f4cd2e4b7e384b4d349b7222ff17959ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:56:45Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:56:45Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"fix(cdn): 子集构建补 define 替换 process.env.NODE_ENV，修复基座白屏\n\n自建 antd 子集直接从 es 源码构建，源码里散布 `process.env.NODE_ENV`\n（官方 UMD 已预替换，我们不会）→ 浏览器抛 `ReferenceError: process is\nnot defined`，window.antd 为 undefined，shell 读 config 报错、\n基座卡在\"正在加载应用资源\"白屏。\n\n- build-subset-externals.mjs：vite 配置加 define 替换\n  NODE_ENV=production / VUE_ENV=client（⚠️ define 是顶层配置，\n  放 build.* 下不生效——第一次就这么踩的）\n- verify-cdn-subsets.cjs：加静态检查\"无裸 process.env 残留\"\n  （jsdom 里有 process，运行时校验抓不到这类问题），85 项全过\n\ndev 已重新投递修复后的 antd.js/icons.js 并验证。","tree":{"sha":"0c7b3f073d0287aa15cd81b4a08ce8e3e0adf2e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/0c7b3f073d0287aa15cd81b4a08ce8e3e0adf2e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/c728470f4cd2e4b7e384b4d349b7222ff17959ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/c728470f4cd2e4b7e384b4d349b7222ff17959ea","node_id":"C_kwDORyTaTdoAKGM3Mjg0NzBmNGNkMmU0YjdlMzg0YjRkMzQ5YjcyMjJmZjE3OTU5ZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/b0564d41cd30561b63f96fedb4ce856fcd5e2692","sha":"b0564d41cd30561b63f96fedb4ce856fcd5e2692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/b0564d41cd30561b63f96fedb4ce856fcd5e2692"}],"sha":"c728470f4cd2e4b7e384b4d349b7222ff17959ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/c728470f4cd2e4b7e384b4d349b7222ff17959ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/b0564d41cd30561b63f96fedb4ce856fcd5e2692/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:28:09Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:28:09Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"perf(cdn): antd / icons 改按需子集，首屏 gzip 从 957KB 降到 727KB\n\n首屏字节账（dev /admin，gzip）里有两个大块是\"没用到却全量下发\"的：\n- antd 官方 UMD 全量 58 个组件 → 421KB\n- @ant-design/icons-vue 全量（~800 个图标）由 shell 打包成 vendor-icons chunk → 186KB\n\n改法：两者都改为「扫描源码 → 只打包实际用到的符号」的按需子集，\n产物形态（UMD + 挂 window.__SHARED__）与消费方式完全不变，业务源码零改动。\n\n1. scripts/build-subset-externals.mjs（新）\n   - 扫描 shell/admin/portal 与共享 UI 的 src：收集 `from ''ant-design-vue''` 的具名导入\n     + 模板 `<a-xxx-yyy>` 标签（按 es 目录最长前缀匹配还原顶层组件），icons 同理。\n     新增组件/图标会自动纳入，不手工维护白名单。\n   - vite lib 构建 UMD → static/cdn/antd.js（355KB gz）/ icons.js（20KB gz）\n   - 排除 antd-all.ts：它是\"全量注册以保留 cssinjs 模板\"的历史 workaround，不是真实\n     使用面；且其注册循环有 `typeof install === ''function''` 判断，缺失项静默跳过。\n2. scripts/verify-cdn-subsets.cjs（新）\n   子集漏组件不会构建报错，只会浏览器里静默不渲染 —— 故在 jsdom 里真加载 UMD、\n   挂载 Vue app 渲染 10 类组件，校验导出/静态方法/图标/ant-* 类名/cssinjs 注入（83 项）。\n3. scripts/deploy.sh：deploy_cdn 默认先重建 CDN 产物。\n   此前只在\"本地目录不存在\"时提示，残留旧产物会被直接上传 —— 子集与源码强耦合，\n   这会变成隐性故障源。CDN_SKIP_REBUILD=1 可跳过。\n4. shell 基座：入口 HTML 加 icons.js；vite 配置把 icons 也 external 到 window.antdIcons\n   （shell 的 vendor-icons chunk 随之消失）。\n\n回退：ANTA_FULL=1（copy 官方全量 UMD）/ ICONS_FULL=1（全量图标），无需改引用方。\n\n实测（dev）：首屏 gzip 957KB → 727KB（-24%），1.1Mbps 下 7.0s → 5.3s；\nverify-cdn-subsets 83 项全通过；新 shell 产物已部署 dev（subset-47aa789）。\n\nMicro-exempt: 仅调整资源打包与引用方式，未改动信息架构、视觉与交互流程","tree":{"sha":"a52a63eb029a8644cd51fbb9e23a1ffc2c61dfd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/a52a63eb029a8644cd51fbb9e23a1ffc2c61dfd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/b0564d41cd30561b63f96fedb4ce856fcd5e2692","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/b0564d41cd30561b63f96fedb4ce856fcd5e2692","node_id":"C_kwDORyTaTdoAKGIwNTY0ZDQxY2QzMDU2MWI2M2Y5NmZlZGI0Y2U4NTZmY2Q1ZTI2OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/47aa7899e83ea0034ff6b4bd4f27a533f9b2a9a6","sha":"47aa7899e83ea0034ff6b4bd4f27a533f9b2a9a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/47aa7899e83ea0034ff6b4bd4f27a533f9b2a9a6"}],"sha":"b0564d41cd30561b63f96fedb4ce856fcd5e2692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/b0564d41cd30561b63f96fedb4ce856fcd5e2692"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/47aa7899e83ea0034ff6b4bd4f27a533f9b2a9a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:31:21Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"web5"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:31:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(build): 微前端产物默认改用 system 格式，启用路由分包 (#223)\n\n此前 MF_FORMAT 默认是 umd —— umd 无法分包，只能产出单文件整包：\nadmin index.js 1.93MB / portal 2.21MB，首屏必须整包下载完才能渲染，\necharts（519KB Dashboard chunk）和非首屏路由的代码也一并拖进来。\n\n改默认 system（loader 的主路径，官方文档与 deploy.sh、流水线配置历来也是这么写）：\n- 入口退化为几百字节的 System.register shim，其余按路由 lazy-load\n- gateway 对 /static/modules/ 下带 hash 的分包本来就发 immutable 强缓存，回访可直接命中\n- 需要旧产物形态时仍可显式传 MF_FORMAT=umd，loader 双格式兼容","tree":{"sha":"793eb501f056087d95d34fe2c0e4bd2e18ad78d