d\n- gateway 对 /static/modules/ 下带 hash 的分包本来就发 immutable 强缓存，回访可直接命中\n- 需要旧产物形态时仍可显式传 MF_FORMAT=umd，loader 双格式兼容","tree":{"sha":"274dcc809f07fa9fbf27e5a144ef9906a80de705","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/274dcc809f07fa9fbf27e5a144ef9906a80de705"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/e6f88fab580af0043bb2944780bdbd972b5c2634","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/e6f88fab580af0043bb2944780bdbd972b5c2634","node_id":"C_kwDORyTaTdoAKGU2Zjg4ZmFiNTgwYWYwMDQzYmIyOTQ0NzgwYmRiZDk3MmI1YzI2MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/web5/web_system/commit/21c2ad664d1fe7e5fc34dd81890559da3edd92e7","sha":"21c2ad664d1fe7e5fc34dd81890559da3edd92e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/21c2ad664d1fe7e5fc34dd81890559da3edd92e7"}],"sha":"e6f88fab580af0043bb2944780bdbd972b5c2634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/e6f88fab580af0043bb2944780bdbd972b5c2634"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/3190f6c0cf8067917d3f63793023e3d90e760100/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T09:45:00Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T09:50:49Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"perf(shell,gateway): 微前端首屏预加载 + 挂载占位，消除加载白屏\n\n根因：模块入口是单文件大包（admin index.js 原始 1.93MB / gzip 约 500KB），\n而基座是「shell 启动完才发起模块请求」的串行瀑布 —— 这段等待里容器里什么\n都没有，用户看到的就是一片空白。\n\n改动：\n1. gateway 渲染基座 html 时按请求路径判定本次命中的模块，注入 <link rel=preload>\n   （无版本指针 + 版本化整包 + 样式指针），主包在解析 HTML 阶段就开始下载，\n   与 14 个 CDN 依赖并行，消掉串行等待；\n2. manifest byEnv 增 version 字段（只给服务端拼第二跳 URL 用，前端不读），\n   否则多环境下会预载到用户用不上的那份（白白多下一次 500KB）；\n3. shell ModuleContainer 在模块下载/挂载期间显示 spinner 占位，不再是空白页；\n4. shell 把已选环境写 Cookie，供服务端挑对该环境的产物（缺失退回 defaultEnv）；\n5. 应急开关 MF_PRELOAD=0 可一键关闭注入，不影响基座启动。\n\nMicro-exempt: 仅新增资源预载与加载态占位，未改动信息架构与交互流程","tree":{"sha":"f4a9c997fee43538ae4ff89fe13cfb9329b665c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/f4a9c997fee43538ae4ff89fe13cfb9329b665c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5