","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/commits/d8e5ee2157e7aa67f0d5bc77f2e7678b7c18081b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:40:54Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T08:40:54Z","email":"wenzhui5@163.com","name":"geekwen"},"message":"fix(redline): R10 Proto sha 提取容错 + auto-pr 自动启用 auto-merge + 开启指南\n\n- scan-rules.sh R10：原用 awk 取第 2 个空格字段，''Proto: <sha>（中文说明）''\n  会把说明一起当 sha → merge-base 判失败误报「Proto 指向非祖先」。\n  改为 grep -oE 只取首个 hex token。\n- auto-pr.yml：建 PR / 分支再 push 时幂等 enableAutoMerge(squash)，\n  分支保护全绿后 GitHub 自动合入；未配置仓库设置时降级 warning 不阻断。\n- docs/development/auto-merge-setup.md：仓库设置两步（Allow auto-merge +\n  master 分支保护必需检查）+ commit trailer 速查表。\n\nRelease: pass（.github/workflows/auto-pr.yml 改动：仅新增 enableAutoMerge\n调用，失败降级 warning 不阻断建 PR 主流程；回滚 = revert 本 commit）","tree":{"sha":"321a069b967239b2f1c289b5beda3eb4b6c814be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/trees/321a069b967239b2f1c289b5beda3eb4b6c814be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/web5/web_system/git/commits/d8e5ee2157e7aa67f0d5bc77f2e7678b7c18081b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7411251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web5","id":7411251,"login":"web5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MTEyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred