lude ShortLinkEntity.\n- Refined ClickEntity by adding new indexes for short link ID and created at timestamp to optimize query performance.","tree":{"sha":"4ecf2b2a2439c30d7aed7d68d40c7aa6af5b2025","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTNam220101/shortlink/git/trees/4ecf2b2a2439c30d7aed7d68d40c7aa6af5b2025"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTNam220101/shortlink/git/commits/29d9163953af829bc014972352f302131e52918d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/LTNam220101/shortlink/commit/29d9163953af829bc014972352f302131e52918d","node_id":"C_kwDORyfmdNoAKDI5ZDkxNjM5NTNhZjgyOWJjMDE0OTcyMzUyZjMwMjEzMWU1MjkxOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LTNam220101/shortlink/commit/240ebc528f49b1b6cf90217e580133d4b6084323","sha":"240ebc528f49b1b6cf90217e580133d4b6084323","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTNam220101/shortlink/commits/240ebc528f49b1b6cf90217e580133d4b6084323"}],"sha":"29d9163953af829bc014972352f302131e52918d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTNam220101/shortlink/commits/29d9163953af829bc014972352f302131e52918d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTNam220101/shortlink/commits/240ebc528f49b1b6cf90217e580133d4b6084323/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T16:09:38Z","email":"thainam.luong@garena.vn","name":"Nam Luong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T16:09:38Z","email":"thainam.luong@garena.vn","name":"Nam Luong"},"message":"Update RabbitMQ configuration and integrate Analytics module\n\n- Changed RabbitMQ URL in environment configuration to use port 5672.\n- Added AnalyticsModule to the application imports for tracking purposes.\n- Configured the application to connect to RabbitMQ as a microservice.\n- Updated ShortLinksService to emit click events to the analytics service instead of saving to the database.","tree":{"sha":"8ace9f73f84171863cd38124212921acd87be681","url":"https://api.g