//api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/8fdbadc3b969a8c1993108c0d655910440dfb762/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:01:01Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T17:01:01Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"v5: train against the commands the device is actually given\n\nv4 stopped a timer and cut a spoken confirmation because it heard «стоп»\ninside «Поставь таймер через минуту» — a sentence said to it daily, whose\nwhole «постав-» family was missing from the negatives. Isolated words were\nthere; sentences, where neighbours run together, were not.\n\nnegative_phrases_ru.txt holds those commands; generate_ha_tts.py renders\nthem through HA''s TTS engines with a voice-level holdout split, and\ntrain_mww.py feeds them in as a separate, more heavily augmented negative\nset. run_v5_chain.sh rebuilt only the negatives and retrained.\n\nThis is the model live since 2026-08-09 02:31 (threshold 0.6, ring 0.4);\nit was deployed without being committed, recorded now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QTXA2q2mxXgvQYqPp6r66p","tree":{"sha":"67248acf1a95ba551aaa18a0cb580688ffd8428b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/67248acf1a95ba551aaa18a0cb580688ffd8428b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/8fdbadc3b969a8c1993108c0d655910440dfb762","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/8fdbadc3b969a8c1993108c0d655910440dfb762","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKDhmZGJhZGMzYjk2OWE4YzE5OTMxMDhjMGQ2NTU5MTA0NDBkZmI3NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/4ac8325ef9a82666c676d43ebd91fa531af5087d","sha":"4ac8325ef9a82666c676d43ebd91fa531af5087d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/4ac8325ef9a82666c676d43ebd91fa531af5087d"}],"sha":"8fdbadc3b969a8c1993108c0d655910440dfb762","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/8fdbadc3b969a8c1993108c0d655910440dfb762"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/4ac8325ef9a82666c676d43ebd91fa531af5087d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T22:20:17Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T22:20:17Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Teach it what this room sounds like\n\nv3 heard the user for the first time -- 22 of 24 held-out utterances against\nv2''s 0 -- and then fired 2.6 times a minute on an empty room. Two hours of it\nrunning produced 312 activations, of which a speech recogniser finds no speech\nat all in 307 and the target word in none. Those clips, plus twenty minutes of\nthe room simply being a room, are the negatives that were missing: the training\nset had generic corpora and the near-silence the speaker leaves while playing,\nbut nothing of this room''s own background.\n\nNothing else moved, so the result is attributable. Measured with\nstopword_eval.py against the same held-out recordings, at the operating point\nthat matches v3''s recall:\n\n  v3 @0.30   recall 15/17   5 false fires on the ring recording\n  v4 @0.20   recall 15/17   1\n  v4 @0.15   recall 16/17   1\n\nand on the two recordings that contain no speech at all -- a ringing timer and\n45 s of the assistant''s own answer -- v4 fires once and never respectively.\nBarge-in over an answer went from 3/4 to 4/4.\n\nThe scale shifted down, which is why v4 looked worse at first: at v3''s\nthreshold it scores 12/24, at its own it scores 22/24. A model''s threshold is\nnot transferable between models and comparing them at a fixed number says\nnothing.\n\nrun_v3_chain.sh / run_v4_chain.sh exist because a nohup''d run died when its\nsession went away, sixty-five minutes in and right after the expensive part.\nThey resume from whatever arrays are already on disk and must be launched with\nsetsid -- nohup only ignores SIGHUP, and a process group killed outright takes\nthe job with it. progress.sh writes one readable line per half-minute, because\na multi-hour run that prints only tqdm spam is indistinguishable from a hung one.\n\nAlso frees the positive array before the negative half of feature extraction:\nlocals live until the function returns, and holding 14 GB through the\nmemory-hungry part is what pushed the first attempt into swap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TYVshj4kiC5bJYNAEKVp5h","tree":{"sha":"de2dfba830493eb4769ae4da3e82f38aae2032e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/de2dfba830493eb4769ae4da3e82f38aae2032e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/4ac8325ef9a82666c676d43ebd91fa531af5087d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/4ac8325ef9a82666c676d43ebd91fa531af5087d","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKDRhYzgzMjVlZjlhODI2NjZjNjc2ZDQzZWJkOTFmYTUzMWFmNTA4N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/f28e91ad0f6c18319cd391f80fd14373281c9acd","sha":"f28e91ad0f6c18319cd391f80fd14373281c9acd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/f28e91ad0f6c18319cd391f80fd14373281c9acd"}],"sha":"4ac8325ef9a82666c676d43ebd91fa531af5087d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/4ac8325ef9a82666c676d43ebd91fa531af5087d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/f28e91ad0f6c18319cd391f80fd14373281c9acd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T17:12:27Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T17:12:27Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Train through a room, not just through Piper\n\nru_stop v2 reported 0.9907 accuracy and could not hear the person it was\nbuilt for. Measured against held-out recordings of the user saying the word\ninto the device''s own microphone, in a quiet room, at -26 dBFS: recall 0/24.\nAgainst held-out Piper samples in the same room noise: 12/12 at 0.996. It had\nlearned four synthetic voices rather than a word, and no measurement in this\nrepo could see that, because --phase test scores Piper against a Piper-trained\nmodel.\n\nThe cause was that _augment_audio applies white noise, a speed change and a\ngain change -- none of which is a channel. Meanwhile training/ already held\n270 measured room impulse responses and hours of real ambient recordings,\nboth unreferenced by any code path, left over from the abandoned openWakeWord\npipeline. Convolving with a real room and adding real background is most of\nthe difference between a clean TTS file and something a microphone might\ndeliver. Passing the held-out synthetic set through just that drops it from\n12/12 to 8/12, median 0.996 to 0.671, which is the model''s fragility to rooms\nstated as a number.\n\nAlso here:\n\nPositives shorter than the 204-frame window were zero-padded in feature space,\nso two thirds of every positive was a value no microphone produces -- real\nquiet measures 1-10 in these units, never 0. They are now padded with real\nroom sound. This does not fully explain the firing on near-silence (the\nfrontend quantises quiet bins to 0 regardless) but the padding was wrong on\nits own terms.\n\ntools/generate_ha_tts.py pulls positives from the speech engines Home\nAssistant is already configured with -- Google Cloud alone exposes ten native\nRussian speakers plus speed and pitch -- and makes no sound doing it, so it\ncan run with someone in the room. 408 clips are in ha_tts_positive, which the\nfeatures phase now picks up alongside elevenlabs_positive at a higher\naugmentation count, there being far fewer of them.\n\ntools/channel_probe.py is the experiment that justified the above rather than\nassuming it.\n\nThe user''s own recordings stay out of training entirely and are used only to\nmeasure recall, which is both the honest way to score this and the answer to\nwhether it would simply overfit to one voice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TYVshj4kiC5bJYNAEKVp5h","tree":{"sha":"8ff9b0e1879f208d8f30bbfd7a71b97b536f2d35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/8ff9b0e1879f208d8f30bbfd7a71b97b536f2d35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/f28e91ad0f6c18319cd391f80fd14373281c9acd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/f28e91ad0f6c18319cd391f80fd14373281c9acd","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKGYyOGU5MWFkMGY2YzE4MzE5Y2QzOTFmODBmZDE0MzczMjgxYzlhY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/4867f169ed2d8037f07a61e58dfa707e40d1b4a3","sha":"4867f169ed2d8037f07a61e58dfa707e40d1b4a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/4867f169ed2d8037f07a61e58dfa707e40d1b4a3"}],"sha":"f28e91ad0f6c18319cd391f80fd14373281c9acd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/f28e91ad0f6c18319cd391f80fd14373281c9acd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/4867f169ed2d8037f07a61e58dfa707e40d1b4a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:01:17Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T16:01:17Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Make the cross-language negative quota idempotent\n\nDeriving the Latin target from the current file count added a fresh quota on\nevery re-run: negative_train grew 25001 -> 31251 -> 37501 across three\ninvocations of --phase generate.\n\nUse the combined absolute total instead, matching how _generate_clips already\ntreats its target elsewhere. A first run fills the Cyrillic quota then tops up\nto the combined figure; a re-run finds the directory already at or above it\nand skips both passes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f07c0af1f0119f4b3d328b865c370483406df32e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/f07c0af1f0119f4b3d328b865c370483406df32e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/4867f169ed2d8037f07a61e58dfa707e40d1b4a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/4867f169ed2d8037f07a61e58dfa707e40d1b4a3","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKDQ4NjdmMTY5ZWQyZDgwMzdmMDdhNjFlNThkZmE3MDdlNDBkMWI0YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/4bd4c462c5e3c8a3199774d6e7df1d795f25d84d","sha":"4bd4c462c5e3c8a3199774d6e7df1d795f25d84d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/4bd4c462c5e3c8a3199774d6e7df1d795f25d84d"}],"sha":"4867f169ed2d8037f07a61e58dfa707e40d1b4a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/4867f169ed2d8037f07a61e58dfa707e40d1b4a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/4bd4c462c5e3c8a3199774d6e7df1d795f25d84d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:23:55Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:23:55Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Halve peak memory when combining negative feature sets\n\nnp.concatenate holds its inputs and its result simultaneously, so combining\nthe adversarial, user and HF negatives peaked at twice their total. With\ndensely-windowed user negatives that total reaches ~12 GB, and the doubling\nwas enough for the OOM killer to take the process with no traceback — the\nlog simply stopped after \"HF negatives: N windows\".\n\nPreallocate the output and copy each source in, releasing it immediately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"593d47d64dc18806527f19838848b46d22ccaf11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/593d47d64dc18806527f19838848b46d22ccaf11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/4bd4c462c5e3c8a3199774d6e7df1d795f25d84d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/4bd4c462c5e3c8a3199774d6e7df1d795f25d84d","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKDRiZDRjNDYyYzVlM2M4YTMxOTk3NzRkNmU3ZGYxZDc5NWYyNWQ4NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/276d52313db7b56453a9d181b117abae09c5a8cc","sha":"276d52313db7b56453a9d181b117abae09c5a8cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/276d52313db7b56453a9d181b117abae09c5a8cc"}],"sha":"4bd4c462c5e3c8a3199774d6e7df1d795f25d84d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/4bd4c462c5e3c8a3199774d6e7df1d795f25d84d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/276d52313db7b56453a9d181b117abae09c5a8cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T17:28:34Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T17:28:34Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Fix cross-language negatives never being generated\n\nLatin and Cyrillic adversarial negatives share one directory, but\n_generate_clips treats its n_total as the target for that directory, not as\nan increment. The Cyrillic pass fills it to n_samples//2, so the Latin call\nthat follows compared 25000 against its own 6250 quota and skipped — the\nEnglish confusables in every config''s negative_phrases were silently never\nsynthesised, on any model trained with this script.\n\nAdd the quota to the current directory count so the Latin pass generates\nits share on top. Verified: neg_train_lat now runs where it previously\nlogged \"25001 clips exist (target 6250) — skip\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e6e18ed3f3a9aa0119cf3c4ad326c5475777460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/5e6e18ed3f3a9aa0119cf3c4ad326c5475777460"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/276d52313db7b56453a9d181b117abae09c5a8cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/276d52313db7b56453a9d181b117abae09c5a8cc","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKDI3NmQ1MjMxM2RiN2I1NjQ1M2E5ZDE4MWIxMTdhYmFlMDljNWE4Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/026f51b8c14f68a901d94909d69cc540f2c2a6ea","sha":"026f51b8c14f68a901d94909d69cc540f2c2a6ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/026f51b8c14f68a901d94909d69cc540f2c2a6ea"}],"sha":"276d52313db7b56453a9d181b117abae09c5a8cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/276d52313db7b56453a9d181b117abae09c5a8cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/026f51b8c14f68a901d94909d69cc540f2c2a6ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:43:02Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:43:02Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Parallelise TTS generation; add ru_stop config\n\nClip generation ran one Piper invocation at a time, and since Piper reloads\nits ONNX model on every call the cost is dominated by process startup — 19\nof 20 cores sat idle at ~1.4 clips/s, putting a 50k-clip run at ~10 hours.\n\nRun them through a thread pool instead: each worker only spawns a subprocess\nand waits, so the GIL never binds and there is nothing to pickle. Measured\n5.8 clips/s on this box (16 workers, ~4x), ETA down to ~2h20m. Piper is\nitself multi-threaded, so the real cores — not the worker count — are the\nceiling. Override with MWW_GEN_WORKERS to share the machine.\n\nru_stop.yaml trains a Russian \"стоп\" for linux-voice-assistant, whose stock\nEnglish stop.tflite cannot separate the word from room noise at any\nthreshold or window size — both saturate at the quantized ceiling of 0.812.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4a2f3ad35fa8602f0c03d718cb71c3b96a38882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/f4a2f3ad35fa8602f0c03d718cb71c3b96a38882"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/026f51b8c14f68a901d94909d69cc540f2c2a6ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/026f51b8c14f68a901d94909d69cc540f2c2a6ea","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKDAyNmY1MWI4YzE0ZjY4YTkwMWQ5NDkwOWQ2OWNjNTQwZjJjMmE2ZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/aae422321083c742e02f5e015baec2d81d899fe2","sha":"aae422321083c742e02f5e015baec2d81d899fe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/aae422321083c742e02f5e015baec2d81d899fe2"}],"sha":"026f51b8c14f68a901d94909d69cc540f2c2a6ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/026f51b8c14f68a901d94909d69cc540f2c2a6ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/aae422321083c742e02f5e015baec2d81d899fe2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T01:17:22Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T01:17:22Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Replace recall claim with held-out evaluation numbers\n\nThe old \"50/50 (100%)\" figure was measured on the 50 record/ WAVs, which\nthe train_with_recordings bug (fixed in the previous commit) had pulled\ninto the positive training set — a train-set measurement. Report instead\nthe held-out evaluation of the current production model: 47/50 (94%)\nrecall on organic activations excluded from training, 1/140 on mined\nhard false-positive clips, cutoff 0.9.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01V3kx8bGM8CcnkxtSdbwQyF","tree":{"sha":"f5614f08345033382782d045551e95309aaee850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/f5614f08345033382782d045551e95309aaee850"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/aae422321083c742e02f5e015baec2d81d899fe2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/aae422321083c742e02f5e015baec2d81d899fe2","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKGFhZTQyMjMyMTA4M2M3NDJlMDJmNWUwMTViYWVjMmQ4MWQ4OTlmZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/859e5b35e22169a884977bb4993700439bc847bb","sha":"859e5b35e22169a884977bb4993700439bc847bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/859e5b35e22169a884977bb4993700439bc847bb"}],"sha":"aae422321083c742e02f5e015baec2d81d899fe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/aae422321083c742e02f5e015baec2d81d899fe2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/859e5b35e22169a884977bb4993700439bc847bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T00:55:18Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T00:55:18Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Fix train_with_recordings being ignored; pin deps; ship FP-mining tools\n\n- load_config never threaded train_with_recordings through, so the\n  features phase always fell back to True and pulled record/ WAVs into\n  the positive training set even when the config said false. Thread it\n  through with the documented default of false.\n- Align load_config defaults with the documented recipe (class weights\n  1.5/1, spectrogram_length 204) and log weights with one decimal.\n- setup_mww.sh: pin microWakeWord to a known-good commit, pin the piper\n  release, and install mmap_ninja (without it HF negatives were silently\n  skipped) and requests (needed by generate_elevenlabs.py).\n- test_mww.py: add --model/--config CLI args instead of edit-the-source.\n- Add batch_test_fps.py and ab_test_fps.py, the false-positive mining\n  tools used for the retraining workflow described in the README.\n- README: fix placeholder linux-voice-assistant link, document the FP\n  tools and the extra manifest fields the exporter writes.\n- .gitignore: cover local experiment logs, model snapshots, and tooling\n  configs so a stray git add -A can''t leak them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01V3kx8bGM8CcnkxtSdbwQyF","tree":{"sha":"abfc01e61209ce998222626616c6329423193159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/abfc01e61209ce998222626616c6329423193159"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/859e5b35e22169a884977bb4993700439bc847bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/859e5b35e22169a884977bb4993700439bc847bb","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKDg1OWU1YjM1ZTIyMTY5YTg4NDk3N2JiNDk5MzcwMDQzOWJjODQ3YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/bec4c035ce491dd6c5e681aeacbba016cfb4a4b6","sha":"bec4c035ce491dd6c5e681aeacbba016cfb4a4b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/bec4c035ce491dd6c5e681aeacbba016cfb4a4b6"}],"sha":"859e5b35e22169a884977bb4993700439bc847bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/859e5b35e22169a884977bb4993700439bc847bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/bec4c035ce491dd6c5e681aeacbba016cfb4a4b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T22:00:33Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T22:00:33Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Add background story and real-world results to README\n\n- Background section explaining motivation (Russian wake word, no existing solution)\n- Results table: 50/50 recall at 0.996 confidence, 82.5 KB model, no ambient FPs\n- Honest FP story: 66 clips collected, retrained, ambient score 0.385 → 0.087\n- Language-agnostic framing (Russian example, any language works)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0565abf195d86aeb2a9fd7fc10836a3d885343ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/0565abf195d86aeb2a9fd7fc10836a3d885343ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/bec4c035ce491dd6c5e681aeacbba016cfb4a4b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/bec4c035ce491dd6c5e681aeacbba016cfb4a4b6","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKGJlYzRjMDM1Y2U0OTFkZDZjNWU2ODFhZWFjYmJhMDE2Y2ZiNGE0YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/02a40fa3ef052152523fded874d44db9b09403e4","sha":"02a40fa3ef052152523fded874d44db9b09403e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/02a40fa3ef052152523fded874d44db9b09403e4"}],"sha":"bec4c035ce491dd6c5e681aeacbba016cfb4a4b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/bec4c035ce491dd6c5e681aeacbba016cfb4a4b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/02a40fa3ef052152523fded874d44db9b09403e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T21:51:31Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T21:51:31Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Restructure as standalone microWakeWord trainer\n\nSplit from combined OWW/MWW repo. This repo now focuses exclusively on\nthe microWakeWord framework (MixedNet streaming CNN, ~83 KB TFLite).\n\n- train_mww.py: complete standalone pipeline (setup→voices→generate→features→train→export)\n- setup_mww.sh: environment setup (TF 2.19, microwakeword, pymicro-features)\n- test_mww.py: evaluate TFLite model against WAV recordings\n- generate_elevenlabs.py: optional high-quality TTS via ElevenLabs API\n- example_ru_jarvis.yaml: fully annotated config template\n- README.md: quick start, phase table, config reference, deployment guide\n\nRemoved OWW-specific files (train_wakeword.py, setup.sh, ru_stop.yaml).\nOpenWakeWord trainer lives at https://github.com/interkelstar/openwakeword-trainer-ru\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"365bf269057c2b1f66caa7997eccd3ad559b3443","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/365bf269057c2b1f66caa7997eccd3ad559b3443"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/02a40fa3ef052152523fded874d44db9b09403e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/02a40fa3ef052152523fded874d44db9b09403e4","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKDAyYTQwZmEzZWYwNTIxNTI1MjNmZGVkODc0ZDQ0ZGI5YjA5NDAzZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/b49de865d23ff25cd3e5e719637dc0fda930bc28","sha":"b49de865d23ff25cd3e5e719637dc0fda930bc28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/b49de865d23ff25cd3e5e719637dc0fda930bc28"}],"sha":"02a40fa3ef052152523fded874d44db9b09403e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/02a40fa3ef052152523fded874d44db9b09403e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/b49de865d23ff25cd3e5e719637dc0fda930bc28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T01:55:57Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T01:55:57Z","email":"kelstar95@gmail.com","name":"Vlad Gevsky"},"message":"Initial commit: config-driven wake word training toolkit for openWakeWord\n\nTrain custom wake words using Piper TTS synthesis — no recordings needed.\nIncludes example configs for Russian \"Джарвис\" and \"Стоп\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd44a13f64f4b0243e0a1cadec2470d407f72b9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/trees/fd44a13f64f4b0243e0a1cadec2470d407f72b9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/git/commits/b49de865d23ff25cd3e5e719637dc0fda930bc28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5422692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar","id":5422692,"login":"interkelstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjI2OTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/interkelstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commit/b49de865d23ff25cd3e5e719637dc0fda930bc28","node_id":"C_kwDORyvgstoAKGI0OWRlODY1ZDIzZmYyNWNkM2U1ZTcxOTYzN2RjMGZkYTkzMGJjMjg","parents":[],"sha":"b49de865d23ff25cd3e5e719637dc0fda930bc28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/interkelstar/microwakeword-trainer/commits/b49de