//api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/14f34d1cb24263c92c4bbc6708181b51a4d4d3c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T18:03:17Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T18:03:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: agent runtime installer in onboarding and settings (#499)\n\n* feat: agent runtime installer in onboarding + settings\n\nAdd guided installation for OpenClaw and Hermes Agent runtimes,\naccessible both from the onboarding wizard (new \"Runtimes\" step)\nand from the Settings panel (\"Agent Runtimes\" section).\n\nNew files:\n- src/lib/agent-runtimes.ts: detection, background install jobs,\n  Docker sidecar compose templates\n- src/app/api/agent-runtimes/route.ts: install, detect, job-status,\n  docker-compose actions\n- src/components/onboarding/step-agent-runtimes.tsx: wizard step with\n  runtime cards showing install/detect status\n- src/components/settings/agent-runtimes-section.tsx: settings panel\n  section for managing runtimes post-onboarding\n\nLocal mode: runs installer commands in background (OpenClaw via\ncurl installer, Hermes via pipx/npm). Docker mode: generates\nsidecar docker-compose service definitions.\n\nAlso fixes:\n- Security scan no longer penalizes score for missing OpenClaw in\n  standalone mode (severity lowered from medium to low)\n- Export clearHermesDetectionCache() for post-install re-detection\n- Add isDocker to capabilities endpoint\n\n* fix: show Install button in Docker mode alongside sidecar YAML option\n\n* feat: add Claude Code and Codex CLI to runtime installer\n\nExtend the agent runtime installer with two additional runtimes:\n- Claude Code (npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code)\n- Codex CLI (npm install -g @openai/codex)\n\nBoth require post-install authentication:\n- Claude: \"claude login\"\n- Codex: \"codex auth\"\n\nThe UI shows auth status (authenticated/needs auth) for runtimes\nthat require it, with the auth command as a hint.\n\n* fix: Docker-safe installs with proper HOME/npm prefix\n\n- Set HOME and npm_config_prefix to .data/ when running in Docker\n  (HOME=/nonexistent causes EACCES for npm global installs)\n- Run ''openclaw onboard --non-interactive'' after OpenClaw install\n- Try pip as fallback for Hermes (after pipx and npm)\n- Shared runInstallCmd helper with Docker-safe env for all runtimes\n\n* fix: use official Hermes curl installer instead of pip/npm\n\n* docs(openapi): add /api/agent-runtimes contract entries\n\n* fix(ci): sync onboarding e2e expectations and openapi parity","tree":{"sha":"5d995e4c8da95201742937ecc32a282782a2d061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/trees/5d995e4c8da95201742937ecc32a282782a2d061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/commits/14f34d1cb24263c92c4bbc6708181b51a4d4d3c0","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d995e4c8da95201742937ecc32a282782a2d061\nparent dd15409a6bd4fb0d7eee84a4ac0d29f896b37158\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774375397 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774375397 +0700\n\nfeat: agent runtime installer in onboarding and settings (#499)\n\n* feat: agent runtime installer in onboarding + settings\n\nAdd guided installation for OpenClaw and Hermes Agent runtimes,\naccessible both from the onboarding wizard (new \"Runtimes\" step)\nand from the Settings panel (\"Agent Runtimes\" section).\n\nNew files:\n- src/lib/agent-runtimes.ts: detection, background install jobs,\n  Docker sidecar compose templates\n- src/app/api/agent-runtimes/route.ts: install, detect, job-status,\n  docker-compose actions\n- src/components/onboarding/step-agent-runtimes.tsx: wizard step with\n  runtime cards showing install/detect status\n- src/components/settings/agent-runtimes-section.tsx: settings panel\n  section for managing runtimes post-onboarding\n\nLocal mode: runs installer commands in background (OpenClaw via\ncurl installer, Hermes via pipx/npm). Docker mode: generates\nsidecar docker-compose service definitions.\n\nAlso fixes:\n- Security scan no longer penalizes score for missing OpenClaw in\n  standalone mode (severity lowered from medium to low)\n- Export clearHermesDetectionCache() for post-install re-detection\n- Add isDocker to capabilities endpoint\n\n* fix: show Install button in Docker mode alongside sidecar YAML option\n\n* feat: add Claude Code and Codex CLI to runtime installer\n\nExtend the agent runtime installer with two additional runtimes:\n- Claude Code (npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code)\n- Codex CLI (npm install -g @openai/codex)\n\nBoth require post-install authentication:\n- Claude: \"claude login\"\n- Codex: \"codex auth\"\n\nThe UI shows auth status (authenticated/needs auth) for runtimes\nthat require it, with the auth command as a hint.\n\n* fix: Docker-safe installs with proper HOME/npm prefix\n\n- Set HOME and npm_config_prefix to .data/ when running in Docker\n  (HOME=/nonexistent causes EACCES for npm global installs)\n- Run ''openclaw onboard --non-interactive'' after OpenClaw install\n- Try pip as fallback for Hermes (after pipx and npm)\n- Shared runInstallCmd helper with Docker-safe env for all runtimes\n\n* fix: use official Hermes curl installer instead of pip/npm\n\n* docs(openapi): add /api/agent-runtimes contract entries\n\n* fix(ci): sync onboarding e2e expectations and openapi parity","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwtHlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMGUQAHiXldF2AzftAGLAvnmqzesO\nt+5EeQgIZs6CGub11PrUuOE0Q3LOpWDdCH1oAep3moPeK