om/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/0f70fd51541fdd4188e52aca39b841e6dd221af6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T17:35:29Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T17:35:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: post-onboarding Launch Sequence for empty dashboards (#500)\n\n* feat: post-onboarding launch sequence for empty dashboards\n\nWhen no agents or tasks exist, the dashboard shows a guided\n\"Launch Sequence\" with three steps:\n1. Agent Runtimes — links to Settings for runtime installation\n2. Dock an Agent — links to the existing Create Agent wizard\n3. Dispatch a Task — links to the task board\n\nEach step activates progressively (step 2 unlocks after step 1,\netc.) with visual state: completed (green), active (amber), locked\n(dimmed). A progress bar shows overall completion.\n\nThe launchpad auto-hides once agents and tasks exist, revealing\nthe normal widget grid underneath.\n\n* fix: fall back to capabilities endpoint for runtime detection\n\n* feat: animated shimmer progress bar in Launch Sequence","tree":{"sha":"06f3ea0c558c83570af1ad6cf6243f5f58d0e40d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/trees/06f3ea0c558c83570af1ad6cf6243f5f58d0e40d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/commits/0f70fd51541fdd4188e52aca39b841e6dd221af6","verification":{"pay