eat: add workspace skill root and root-based filtering to Skills Hub (#408)\n\n- Add `workspace` skill root (~/.openclaw/workspace/skills) for\n  workspace-local skill discovery alongside the existing 5 roots\n- Make group cards clickable to filter the installed skills list by root\n- Add `workspace` as valid target for skill creation and registry install\n- Add `showAllRoots` i18n key to all 10 locale files\n\nCloses #364","tree":{"sha":"e3974a32d0372a1f704bf5372d00fb6ca7da7ca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/trees/e3974a32d0372a1f704bf5372d00fb6ca7da7ca8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/commits/6f1237704a0147ef766f9687ea55fd499de2c54a","verification":{"payload":"tree e3974a32d0372a1f704bf5372d00fb6ca7da7ca8\nparent 17bf0761f5effa40a7e459a4acbc1c06c8f5859e\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1773639471 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773639471 +0700\n\nfeat: add workspace skill root and root-based filtering to Skills Hub (#408)\n\n- Add `workspace` skill root (~/.openclaw/workspace/skills) for\n  workspace-local skill discovery alongside the existing 5 roots\n- Make group cards clickable to filter the installed skills list by root\n- Add `workspace` as valid target for skill creation and registry install\n- Add `showAllRoots` i18n key to all 10 locale files\n\nCloses #364","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpt5cvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzBUQAE/emgQcG5lMVXNDrdHNlaI+\nsVDJ6naEAZzoCpWsInO5sYwJdCaEENuXzD+G6h43TPW6Ekz2lWXmotJ5VOFG2JYk\n9ylGT250XIQlxrNzc4uLhJJMTKwkrcKD13jqnPYa8VcF+L8JzxzQf2IhjoqOGUkx\n4BMtebuYS0CQUvglSZddidVZPh1PTv5U+xy+QlgGruUQj1PG+ROxb2oMqEpwObbK\n28AforDTHSEo0P959nMOj9G623ZesZhk3w/d4J1T845KOce7ztJEJSCdOLm4pjoj\nia8u0uyxyN48pDomVR58v0fsNBLGZ/DDBktQD2vej8YESZzJWrCN6/qIdaAeuDTZ\ngeYLPDgkqoFjnFBHAUiYVFjEhnO5jZxutkuY8wEEH+go/Pk0cfCmViINh8i6M/Cq\nCOrchL8TAJxE/WzhwojVCTfoTJEXLYe0iLqQ0U9mNpS5zDnmH+p1+QmXqZ5WcbKx\nIZVJcRpgrC