d auto-fix for `tools.exec.security`. Current OpenClaw validates\n  only: deny, allowlist, full. The old `sandbox` value was rejected.\n\nCloses #357, closes #356","tree":{"sha":"dcb6138fb23fbca9ec0b63900033706ef3ed0ce3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/trees/dcb6138fb23fbca9ec0b63900033706ef3ed0ce3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/commits/24493638682463a65ec29ebb550a00bd14098816","verification":{"payload":"tree dcb6138fb23fbca9ec0b63900033706ef3ed0ce3\nparent 3525c4543fcaab3ddb7c4b1bc383cb8e1e205c5a\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1773499451 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773499451 +0700\n\nfix: stop forcing dangerouslyDisableDeviceAuth + fix exec security value\n\n- Remove unconditional `dangerouslyDisableDeviceAuth = true` from MC\n  origin registration. MC should only add its origin to allowedOrigins,\n  not silently downgrade the gateway''s device auth security posture.\n\n- Replace invalid `sandbox` value with `allowlist` in security scan\n  and auto-fix for `tools.exec.security`. Current OpenClaw validates\n  only: deny, allowlist, full. The old `sandbox` value was rejected.\n\nCloses #357, closes #356","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJptXQ7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAM+oQAHRQy32puQ2/woHpKnCFFcH2\nxCBXtHQZ5AZp3+wfPUdEnceuHvkCMK1QWUhPo37CrkZ4dpadRMjmH18KzpzsRs7C\nZl0TxK23+Mjb18zCiYuTF0N7Gf+QWuBD5Lx1d8WEnyD7UveF3gHq6Xy2KtnOMTMK\nAc2LHYSwNFNa0DmF9eYw5AqGdICcrqeLx6c2WtXBvRrYR94Npo5eBuMlohRCj+9/\nLFwlz+ig27bzeYwX9p/0Ei+PxTkEVH0+IxY0rubpk0/rMMh32RadrPZBngj9PdU9\ncEM51m2CyeyvHDCkd7Tbzp07eb6oZfztphgjgNUoHkk2tu1WUGELbPHAGdPG3NO6\ngrfJABtprRUMqa4eZQCwqcFF79kDz7hIyuo1YKMGtIa5ldeQiG2m9J+Wm5aswOrk\nEqsnQYeok5Blj5Dwp80huz2H7kFhNNyii+rd9mTjhFzGDdu+XFnXEpTKwOU6LfrX\nbrFQCWwBsVHj1koQLKXnJMth4rk03cFrE9IejgLIcnDC42fnHzQnJKn8lefRwdAL\n84DIgmMsYvoADMcyTD82JAjXBLvIp8HHxl6ghWzf0yn32K4zbwcwzGa9vgCvcmuj\nR5RRht+YNxLldmcWASjbqshqz89TlLjTX25MRo49PE