sts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/selva-arch/mission-control/commit/8386cfbec0abf36aa9b9b9a0571c3a9792dfc54b","node_id":"C_kwDORy4A5toAKDgzODZjZmJlYzBhYmYzNmFhOWI5YjlhMDU3MWMzYTk3OTJkZmM1NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/selva-arch/mission-control/commit/2fe7785433d5204d740e617bcef594205c2cf235","sha":"2fe7785433d5204d740e617bcef594205c2cf235","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/2fe7785433d5204d740e617bcef594205c2cf235"}],"sha":"8386cfbec0abf36aa9b9b9a0571c3a9792dfc54b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/8386cfbec0abf36aa9b9b9a0571c3a9792dfc54b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264638470?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HonzysClawdbot","id":264638470,"login":"HonzysClawdbot","node_id":"U_kgDOD8YQBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/2fe7785433d5204d740e617bcef594205c2cf235/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T09:39:02Z","email":"janclawdbotstratil@gmail.com","name":"HonzysClawdbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T09:39:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add gateway health history e2e + utility unit tests\n\n* fix: show all agents in command select, disable those without active session\n\nPreviously the agent select in the OrchestrationBar only listed agents\nwith a session_key set (agents.filter(a => a.session_key)), causing the\ndropdown to appear completely empty when agents exist but none have an\nactive session. This was confusing — users thought no agents were\nregistered.\n\nFix: show all registered agents in the dropdown. Agents without an\nactive session_key are shown as disabled with a ''— no session'' suffix\nand a tooltip explaining why they can''t be messaged. The ''No agents\nregistered'' placeholder is shown only when the agents array is truly\nempty.\n\nThe send button remains correctly disabled when no valid agent is\nselected.\n\nFixes #321\n\n* test: add gateway health history e2e + utility unit tests\n\n- Add tests/gateway-health-history.spec.ts: Playwright e2e tests for\n  GET /api/gateways/health/history and POST /api/gateways/health\n  covering auth guards, response shape validation, chronological\n  ordering, and gateway name resolution.\n\n- Add src/app/api/gateways/health/health-utils.test.ts: 30 vitest\n  unit tests for the pure utility functions in the health probe route:\n  ipv4InCidr, isBlockedUrl (SSRF protection), buildGatewayProbeUrl,\n  parseGatewayVersion, and hasOpenClaw32ToolsProfileRisk.\n\nAll 30 unit tests pass. Covers the health history feature introduced\nin feat(gateways): add health history logging and timeline (#300).","tree":{"sha":"7ad7d3c81e1fb6d75b590731235e9516e374d2f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/trees/7ad7d3c81e1fb6d75b590731235e9516e374d2f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/commits/2fe7785433d5204d740e617bcef594205c2cf235","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ad7d3c81e1fb6d75b590731235e9516e374d2f2\nparent 5d7b05b4f6d47416e4e08b6e2805e1e26d352e95\nauthor HonzysClawdbot <janclawdbotstratil@gmail.com> 1773481142 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773481142 +0700\n\ntest: add gateway health history e2e + utility unit tests\n\n* fix: show all agents in command select, disable those without active session\n\nPreviously the agent select in the OrchestrationBar only listed agents\nwith a session_key set (agents.filter(a => a.session_key)), causing the\ndropdown to appear completely empty when agents exist but none have an\nactive session. This was confusing — users thought no agents were\nregistered.\n\nFix: show all registered agents in the dropdown. Agents without an\nactive session_key are shown as disabled with a ''— no session'' suffix\nand a tooltip explaining why they can''t be messaged. The ''No agents\nregistered'' placeholder is shown only when the agents array is truly\nempty.\n\nThe send button remains correctly disabled when no valid agent is\nselected.\n\nFixes #321\n\n* test: add gateway health history e2e + utility unit tests\n\n- Add tests/gateway-health-history.spec.ts: Playwright e2e tests for\n  GET /api/gateways/health/history and POST /api/gateways/health\n  covering auth guards, response shape validation, chronological\n  ordering, and gateway name resolution.\n\n- Add src/app/api/gateways/health/health-utils.test.ts: 30 vitest\n  unit tests for the pure utility functions in the health probe route:\n  ipv4InCidr, isBlockedUrl (SSRF protection), buildGatewayProbeUrl,\n  parseGatewayVersion, and hasOpenClaw32ToolsProfileRisk.\n\nAll 30 unit tests pass. Covers the health history feature introduced\nin feat(gateways): add health history logging and timeline (#300).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJptSy2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzkwQAJryzU3HjetZY5niFCvlKfNi\nkSK7FjQAKAuxtHVig3ynuiuccGBLMc4qrDMWy8sBoEHd3BOFPv+Fga5XNN04YThZ\nEStMsknHPUkcm4h9dPjA2NtnllAhNnMpgd7zU/bY5LX1WwLKNezdL/KLZN3fqwvn\n4afFsQX8s9Uv/FDF3zinEi5KCM+7zcsqKyNOZhM/GOyN6BC+QwY4+efkT4H2LGtA\n6iGzMnMjeeQlP3reai4VEw0bPVCHJVg/pgMqxpusYAVs+f/Qx+eznSsqSLajWbao\n9lXiKuRpP1sCWIyroSKp9mYU5Efa2mMqu6qH+Br2RNOb1g8zq1eZaZL0cgR+LLX+\nR3HWrxUBIMfrXla6LYDEp5J1aRJdcBNJTxufnyoHhTF05kw1XKeXJA31OxCJujXU\nj14lMDbxAQcpG5FQd7+lb4BhAubY5BedlFZoQs5NXV7p65SjcQIadH5Br93DYqAQ\nbUlkQ6euaGguJFvRnsuH+roua6m2TeZcoYszDsyvnajecEUUBc9OL215pUpjJJIn\ncr6DsKRZ6ks/PJkislaBc+bgN22KBSjPjYsdhJEX5M3I5aUuUSt9izhP/yEklJXG\nOpByNfRAsQgAYF8KytxUtijjjUf1Sn0bRq2KGne0Yc8xd2i3qD2jW5nbkQNE/U8Z\nPg6o/r8ayXS4LM5JWps4\n=No92\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T03:14:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/selva-arch/mission-control/commit/2fe7785433d5204d740e617bcef594205c2cf235","node_id":"C_kwDORy4A5toAKDJmZTc3ODU0MzNkNTIwNGQ3NDBlNjE3YmNlZjU5NDIwNWMyY2YyMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/selva-arch/mission-control/commit/5d7b05b4f6d47416e4e08b6e2805e1e26d352e95","sha":"5d7b05b4f6d47416e4e08b6e2805e1e26d352e95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/5d7b05b4f6d47416e4e08b6e2805e1e26d352e95"}],"sha":"2fe7785433d5204d740e617bcef594205c2cf235","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/2fe7785433d5204d740e617bcef594205c2cf235"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17442606?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomwattsca/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomwattsca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomwattsca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomwattsca/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomwattsca","id":17442606,"login":"tomwattsca","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDQyNjA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomwattsca/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomwattsca/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomwattsca/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomwattsca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomwattsca/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomwattsca","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/5d7b05b4f6d47416e4e08b6e2805e1e26d352e95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T09:38:55Z","email":"tom@topshelfmedia.ca","name":"Tom Watts"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T09:38:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(tasks): use --expect-final for agent dispatch and Aegis review\n\nThe two-step agent → agent.wait pattern used in dispatchAssignedTasks and\nrunAegisReviews only returns lifecycle metadata (runId, status, timestamps).\nThe agent''s actual response text is only available via --expect-final on the\ninitial agent call, which blocks until completion and returns the full payload\nincluding result.payloads[0].text.\n\nWithout this fix:\n- Task resolution is stored as the raw wait JSON instead of the agent''s response\n- Aegis cannot parse a VERDICT from the resolution, so it always defaults to rejected\n- Tasks are permanently stuck in a reject/retry loop and never complete\n\nFix: replace the two-call pattern with a single --expect-final call in both\ndispatchAssignedTasks and runAegisReviews. Also improve sessionId extraction\nto use the agentMeta path from the final payload.\n\nCo-authored-by: Tom Watts <tom@techteamup.com>","tree":{"sha":"a20e30e86d480f21411f1e79bf35b4d29c535279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/trees/a20e30e86d480f21411f1e79bf35b4d29c535279"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/commits/5d7b05b4f6d47416e4e08b6e2805e1e26d352e95","verification":{"payload":"tree a20e30e86d480f21411f1e79bf35b4d29c535279\nparent 4fa1cbd3a5bc230a8126f002cf5608c646255292\nauthor Tom Watts <tom@topshelfmedia.ca> 1773481135 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773481135 +0700\n\nfix(tasks): use --expect-final for agent dispatch and Aegis review\n\nThe two-step agent → agent.wait pattern used in dispatchAssignedTasks and\nrunAegisReviews only returns lifecycle metadata (runId, status, timestamps).\nThe agent''s actual response text is only available via --expect-final on the\ninitial agent call, which blocks until completion and returns the full payload\nincluding result.payloads[0].text.\n\nWithout this fix:\n- Task resolution is stored as the raw wait JSON instead of the agent''s response\n- Aegis cannot parse a VERDICT from the resolution, so it always defaults to rejected\n- Tasks are permanently stuck in a reject/retry loop and never complete\n\nFix: replace the two-call pattern with a single --expect-final call in both\ndispatchAssignedTasks and runAegisReviews. Also improve sessionId extraction\nto use the agentMeta path from the final payload.\n\nCo-authored-by: Tom Watts <tom@techteamup.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJptSyvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACGkQAFkcM87W2EiwVH72LLCxLMs6\nZcGqlhjhXJqwvn49HfNh0kR8CqvwbGuC0qEwB0qOXNB6zps0wo2gyv395Ni9RUVM\nFDp+OtWm6vEZSdIg2QZMJAsn8Q2dg9DS0jdWhO0kL8VENuw0yJm6qLkFagkyQpvN\nTfL/LwoqjtE7uJ5EfnRDqAmkuPv6YPNjDdzflMBK97iPJBgYjDPKjVlS/JDY3WRP\nFjxdzLHf0Gh1OwRKUoOTS/ifPIrLyAmQRatUHtDRrWHpGETWhSNCYNX8jk/6aHIS\n0euIXMM6o5hK66xhqWulRKweI4ngNgXIJxqZyRRVE0N35ytwh6qb/fWMzaWLITPL\nJvEkL8nVTmwi2MaZHuajK4D5NL4GBTVt6Ummuq1MXzVtdb4J8GKNHRLgv33v1gGh\nK3SUpk/aUZCjUehCiq65GfDfO68XmyeBhNe4651HQa8pvlPn8GlanMUZdrSaBNhn\nMn/xMfVux6eJe42RhcB2y4uI3KyjV07+WnGwJWWNacqvykrTCS17IEV7O63tAxCQ\n7s4t7+ZT0yfIO4wKN94wbITCBC0R76khtNzcpW/NC2iclefdp+C+I6QaVr+FeYFq\nE3ZcO9lEaDAwTzzQBEE+GZ6x6HQYIqnjD7VSs1w0XyDhYdUa5FWRcjwHFP31j3dG\nRiDwbxiDUXAJvgMcboFz\n=QRr+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T03:14:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/selva-arch/mission-control/commit/5d7b05b4f6d47416e4e08b6e2805e1e26d352e95","node_id":"C_kwDORy4A5toAKDVkN2IwNWI0ZjZkNDc0MTZlNGUwOGI2ZTI4MDVlMWUyNmQzNTJlOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/selva-arch/mission-control/commit/4fa1cbd3a5bc230a8126f002cf5608c646255292","sha":"4fa1cbd3a5bc230a8126f002cf5608c646255292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/4fa1cbd3a5bc230a8126f002cf5608c646255292"}],"sha":"5d7b05b4f6d47416e4e08b6e2805e1e26d352e95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/5d7b05b4f6d47416e4e08b6e2805e1e26d352e95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264638470?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HonzysClawdbot","id":264638470,"login":"HonzysClawdbot","node_id":"U_kgDOD8YQBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HonzysClawdbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/4fa1cbd3a5bc230a8126f002cf5608c646255292/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T09:38:53Z","email":"janclawdbotstratil@gmail.com","name":"HonzysClawdbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T09:38:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: show all agents in command select, disable those without active session\n\nPreviously the agent select in the OrchestrationBar only listed agents\nwith a session_key set (agents.filter(a => a.session_key)), causing the\ndropdown to appear completely empty when agents exist but none have an\nactive session. This was confusing — users thought no agents were\nregistered.\n\nFix: show all registered agents in the dropdown. Agents without an\nactive session_key are shown as disabled with a ''— no session'' suffix\nand a tooltip explaining why they can''t be messaged. The ''No agents\nregistered'' placeholder is shown only when the agents array is truly\nempty.\n\nThe send button remains correctly disabled when no valid agent is\nselected.\n\nFixes #321","tree":{"sha":"89656d95e2c45dcb854900d54b55b4cdbbaed39c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/trees/89656d95e2c45dcb854900d54b55b4cdbbaed39c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/commits/4fa1cbd3a5bc230a8126f002cf5608c646255292","verification":{"payload":"tree 89656d95e2c45dcb854900d54b55b4cdbbaed39c\nparent 176e862431f36ad0b8d0cf3970765100e5473dd8\nauthor HonzysClawdbot <janclawdbotstratil@gmail.com> 1773481133 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773481133 +0700\n\nfix: show all agents in command select, disable those without active session\n\nPreviously the agent select in the OrchestrationBar only listed agents\nwith a session_key set (agents.filter(a => a.session_key)), causing the\ndropdown to appear completely empty when agents exist but none have an\nactive session. This was confusing — users thought no agents were\nregistered.\n\nFix: show all registered agents in the dropdown. Agents without an\nactive session_key are shown as disabled with a ''— no session'' suffix\nand a tooltip explaining why they can''t be messaged. The ''No agents\nregistered'' placeholder is shown only when the agents array is truly\nempty.\n\nThe send button remains correctly disabled when no valid agent is\nselected.\n\nFixes #321","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJptSytCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxocQALFtDovlFv9+don3vdr9sUY1\nkFLotwS0nOHzyF8Vz4jCftk2/3UVe8dr9cHbVPYzdLLRbNsYExIbG09mHODNoH5Y\n+8vo9DssEBv/20JGZKyGycfwZ7loPiWpFej5m9AP4NigE+xq0eYv5MCnENSzQ/bR\nsiE+mJQlXxdjamq2Asq1nWZjMNXaOCCXdXYgMoXqvauWh118ls+NUf7yTjPyLteN\n4T7zLYoc/4rd6jazSaiByEnuh12yyJLFoFW3MlnClGF/QEdsFoJLZuWIqDjLk+/m\nRCrWINgYw+2phe9aAof+3JwR9hD0ikyRY4S2Pbn2BIzfWUiKprrDhXLyxoUeHMBM\nA4a9NDpTHcdTpWJB0MWgiu4jw0aa5rpFOs24f/t5gp/6nYSdxymWofxR40CIPkbK\nLvLHlR1OmMdhVpBs2wgE0RvkX7ZjGyrV/VggEeyMbCwA5UTkck8GC1HA62lT38ze\ngxXmYe0e/zSvyrwxugdc4n1135ia9Hh7vpBK+YOiye3al11tXziJdMHHMXIaG0YY\nsKwXwpjMcKEts2xMw96A9f/ArLo+5aMPb/QGuiKPJJa/CCUrDhl+NLnMfTtWrVPH\ns4+L0cHff1Do2WWnUij/pSvUnCUvrHBvK5ZDwhCVdEpSmJyFRWNNxU3Ard2hZj3g\nWAc175hjmSnpNsw8YVLO\n=ok29\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T03:14:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/selva-arch/mission-control/commit/4fa1cbd3a5bc230a8126f002cf5608c646255292","node_id":"C_kwDORy4A5toAKDRmYTFjYmQzYTViYzIzMGE4MTI2ZjAwMmNmNTYwOGM2NDYyNTUyOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/selva-arch/mission-control/commit/176e862431f36ad0b8d0cf3970765100e5473dd8","sha":"176e862431f36ad0b8d0cf3970765100e5473dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/176e862431f36ad0b8d0cf3970765100e5473dd8"}],"sha":"4fa1cbd3a5bc230a8126f002cf5608c646255292","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/4fa1cbd3a5bc230a8126f002cf5608c646255292"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/commits/176e862431f36ad0b8d0cf3970765100e5473dd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T09:29:24Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T09:29:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui): improve agent panel empty state with discovery hints (#348)\n\nReplace the unhelpful \"POST /api/agents with X-Api-Key header\" message\nwith a user-friendly hint explaining that agents are auto-discovered\nfrom Claude, Codex, and Hermes directories, and that gateway mode shows\nregistered agents.\n\nAdds missing noAgentsHint translation key across all 10 locales.\n\nCloses #321","tree":{"sha":"d51fc8f7ffd677c8c44cbcd5ea347fed4780305d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/trees/d51fc8f7ffd677c8c44cbcd5ea347fed4780305d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/selva-arch/mission-control/git/commits/176e862431f36ad0b8d0cf3970765100e5473dd8","verification":{"payload":"tree d51fc8f7ffd677c8c44cbcd5ea347fed4780305d\nparent 466a1621d4dbc443c2e6eaae326ecefc72b4ad8c\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1773480564 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773480564 +0700\n\nfix(ui): improve agent panel empty state with discovery hints (#348)\n\nReplace the unhelpful \"POST /api/agents with X-Api-Key header\" message\nwith a user-friendly hint explaining that agents are auto-discovered\nfrom Claude, Codex, and Hermes directories, and that gateway mode shows\nregistered agents.\n\nAdds missing noAgentsHint translation key across all 10 locales.\n\nCloses #321","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJptSp0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9pwQAB7FIFYj8adAsW1OUvGHuZMG\n390D0IFDDrjyT1A4cgxleSGmJ5dKMSWljVhCVspE+Yp36JtZv0MIiAdOpmQWnE3O\nZWXFSBOmUBXiTWp1jPrai7tOcS3lVnc8Ig1vRYePmUzVVsabciFrmvw1FVLpko6D\niCCGXGYUEzHeI0YISRiJDyY7yR9/Pq1Cp8eGv7tXxHQQBSNObCMqs5SQZ/ESUM3W\nc8+iFAdr3zEPAO0Wau0k0riHsZ0EF2FjDuG+YlpkoZK0JiuEFNRMiyjPQBd7YAT1\nqa2m43cu3llgwldsjr7XCjuQDMR3kqaijpNRXxBCW/HIwSc10gx5CZu+SZkd8Tj/\n/zDRW8FGi4zLTu/ZPET+ZftcTUeyo1JJqTgkBkiw