emits a skipped matrix job with its `${{ matrix.* }}` expressions\nleft unexpanded, so the name carries no real version (seen on\njaffadog/plugin-ci-fixtures run 31863158665 for a skipped integration\njob). parseJobName already ignores such names in both forms because `$`\nis outside `[\\w.-]`; pin that so a later pattern change cannot start\nrecording a version-less job as a platform result.","tree":{"sha":"0126c5a2ff5fda7cb633ffd581f339f6d2320982","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/git/trees/0126c5a2ff5fda7cb633ffd581f339f6d2320982"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/git/commits/e7851eba3a0c12d0e7ba979f92544561c6658fe6","verification":{"payload":"tree 0126c5a2ff5fda7cb633ffd581f339f6d2320982\nparent f8982110d2b9eddad0d80c1dcea42315bc977099\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1789666305 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789666305 +1200\n\ntest(api): ignore unexpanded matrix job names (#100)\n\nGitHub emits a skipped matrix job with its `${{ matrix.* }}` expressions\nleft unexpanded, so the name carries no real version (seen on\njaffadog/plugin-ci-fixtures run 31863158665 for a skipped integration\njob). parseJobName already ignores such names in both forms because `$`\nis outside `[\\w.-]`; pin that so a later pattern change cannot start\nrecording a version-less job as a platform result.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrCQBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQ9YQAH7U/b1rInBm4leY6gI6Qsfp\n80crrVBjkiDF6/YrO2+fVwodBdTCzXaQaR2OOdNmxE+NwHZXW8ODmBBSZCu2AUcD\nv4XKcxMnhJEJhNsoUCxfVfzuCPl0YWlrWPasHAmIacU2SKNfDh9stnqelUMwPPJg\nx5gslVllZyCmh/rb1JoZBoqZvw64VZBb59gN8nvgbGMw5ARjixRCSG6eRwn3lLNv\nPq9FwEXTQtqI2tyaPEjjLC+BWY++yFqVcwfmZrkI3JczKd4qpNoNYDsWLUg5IM/3\nbOA3yb4OTyicW0jHbs4paBZmZ77Rt89ENyPK6dFmekJzk7GnNtwLwiN41uP7CPK9\n1L/jgNKsiAQiiEcRaFjZOZ/0WZkzALwfwXxteSAcZFWqHaxuZaSHXkAbKkaJXZ+O\neRqMmWffbxAqvs5ZCbPxdlTKnGE2tuEgPD0x3isgJKjlitMm005WZsp