=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/commits/f8982110d2b9eddad0d80c1dcea42315bc977099/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:25:03Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T17:25:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api): accept both plugin-ci job-name forms (#99)\n\nThe reusable plugin-ci workflow is about to publish its platform jobs\nas \"Install & Test: <os> (Node <n>)\" alongside today''s \"<os> / Node <n>\"\n(SignalK/signalk-server#2853). The matrix parser only knew the latter,\nso runs using the new form would be stored with an empty jobs array -\nthe score is unaffected, but the indicators-tab matrix would go blank.\n\nAccept both forms per job kind, keep every pattern anchored so an\nadvisory lane like \"Linux / Node 26 (experimental)\" is never recorded\nas a platform result, and export parseJobName for a direct unit test.","tree":{"sha":"3ed59acc192695937831d9bb20f7e28e895fe32b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/git/trees/3ed59acc192695937831d9bb20f7e28e895fe32b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/git/commits/f8982110d2b9eddad0d80c1dcea42315bc977099","verification":{"payload":"tree 3ed59acc192695937831d9bb20f7e28e895fe32b\nparent 2417e42e1a6b38abe0c4fbf8fe23b2d398b8936a\nauthor Dirk Wahrheit <86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com> 1789665903 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789665903 +1200\n\nfeat(api): accept both plugin-ci job-name forms (#99)\n\nThe reusable plugin-ci workflow is about to publish its platform jobs\nas \"Install & Test: <os> (Node <n>)\" alongside today''s \"<os> / Node <n>\"\n(SignalK/signalk-server#2853). The matrix parser only knew the latter,\nso runs using the new form would be stored with an empty jobs array -\nthe score is unaffected, but the indicators-tab matrix would go blank.\n\nAccept both forms per job kind, keep every pattern anchored so an\nadvisory lane like \"Linux / Node 26 (experimental)\" is never recorded\nas a platform result, and export parseJobName for a direct unit test.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrCJvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWeUQAJNc+rnFdjVTXyFqTp+1qDaL\n1vEuMAw7owgh2PCvSVAqAW0gzBFju9LO3DFo9z+KCEfI2bQhqK3tKwwj5pWpiWSq\npwZYhNVaLP93PoSBXBzHNaiXCIiPJ64+dF/PCEQ6HTI2q9XtTUF+aMxIlbywaZ1h\ndLS8BXVQ8mIc3Th5nBBF4AqZGlQDd4wIS2OvAYQK24luEW/U1zZHgw6BJMuGxUGA\nyHxaDaqI1/OGE16RJ0Ab2HPehJ5+3KRK5fIH7+Pqgwxucotr4BQ8HGmZsCH9g7Kn\nbsYnLVoT1w4D0A65dUZc26QLE+cn7MLXwwlk2ApuSlUP6AfNIJ+u4MTnfKpu+82v\nv14Qr1cGg2pEoASDY44ct2gjFBnf6JAOcDrTPTHWTc04uz2u+cS+T2WRvl7ABmov\nvXhGCPuFrRbzi5TP29HaJQN7W/CZAOERl612GNJgWeLCw0ELMVaf6Xo9HWE3lqEy\nT+Drdtgb8Y544LZbK+YIxjcVoBbKGY8qCnqp7HUL2si++mjEhiYkZDnsMobZU7iI\ntkoQ9HLfijwkIpTU328dTAQKZ49HWh7d/zOIkTyPGv0ID1pE9VKZcSziJT4zk7wj\nU004k//AdwffDtsMPySHGlfvmCKeBnzEAMoegX76wfKq6hjAKeFUK6OOrlRABq3T\nAQG80rUA+TsegVaTB2I6\n=iiBH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T17:25:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avat