gistry/commits/d8bb540a879a6c34449543e2ec4b2c8e9cc39006/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T17:57:40Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T17:59:17Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(detect): bound and guard crash messages\n\nSelf-audit findings on the crash handlers: the crash message is\nplugin-controlled and flowed uncapped into the published record — cap\nit at 500 chars, matching the spirit of the runner-side 300-char cap.\nAnd the log line ran unguarded before the file write; a throw inside\nan uncaughtException listener aborts the process, so write the result\nfile first and guard the log. Two new fixture tests pin both.","tree":{"sha":"cc192319c1dfc471bbf462bb1825400ae12864c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/git/trees/cc192319c1dfc471bbf462bb1825400ae12864c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/git/commits/d8bb540a879a6c34449543e2ec4b2c8e9cc39006","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86628605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dirkwa","id":86628605,"login":"dirkwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NjI4NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dirkwa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/commit/d8bb540a879a6c34449543e2ec4b2c8e9cc39006","node_id":"C_kwDORy6_G9oAKGQ4YmI1NDBhODc5YTZjMzQ0NDk1NDNlMmVjNGIyYzhlOWNjMzkwMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/commit/b9e550fe1c0d2b9d058f33adc139b32400d0d47c","sha":"b9e550fe1c0d2b9d058f33adc139b32400d0d47c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/commits/b9e550fe1c0d2b9d058f33adc139b32400d0d47c"}],"sha":"d8bb540a879a6c34449543e2ec4b2c8e9cc39006","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/commits/d8bb540a879a6c34449543e2ec4b2c8e9cc39006"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/commits/b9e550fe1c0d2b9d058f33adc139b32400d0d47c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T17:47:00Z","email":"dirkwahrtheit@gmail.com","name":"dirkwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T17:59:17Z","email":"86628605+dirkwa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dirk Wahrheit"},"message":"fix(detect): surface real plugin crash errors\n\nA plugin can kill the detection subprocess outside the promise chain —\nbt-sensors-plugin-sk''s dangling import() rejection is the live case —\nand the process died before writing its result file, so the published\nrecord only ever showed the generic \"sandboxed detection failed\".\n\nInstall uncaughtException/unhandledRejection handlers in\ndetect-sandboxed that write a crash result carrying the real error\nbefore exiting. For the ways the process can still die without a file\n(timeout, SIGKILL, firejail itself), the runner now appends a compact\nreason — mapped exit codes or the first error-looking stderr line — to\nthe fallback loadError.","tree":{"sha":"b7e7e2329f714d077d85df58ddc9fa314987caa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SignalK/signalk-plugin-registry/git/trees/b7e7e2329f7