d endpoints to shared conventions\n\n- Move service registration to AddApiApplicationServices and remove BuilderExtensionMethods.cs\n- Introduce shared extensions for middleware, endpoint grouping, and route construction (ApiServiceCollectionExtensions, ApiApplicationBuilderExtensions, ApiEndpointConventions, ApiRoutes)\n- Update all endpoint slices to use MapApiGroup, RequireReadAccess, and RequireWriteAccess\n- Standardize Created responses with ApiEndpointConventions.CreatedResource\n- Improve GetCurrentUserId to throw on unauthenticated access\n- Add idempotency key to CreatePaymentRequest\n- Update architecture tests for new conventions and builder extension removal\n- Enforces vertical slice architecture and reduces duplication","tree":{"sha":"62e815263195b134dc436e2bc086a8349b5f6e01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/trees/62e815263195b134dc436e2bc086a8349b5f6e01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/commits/aaac1efab30fb6825d02a173cc5f4e525efd46c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90131084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro","id":90131084,"login":"mattiamuraro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMTMxMDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.g