aro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T21:02:32Z","email":"mattia.muraro@beta80group.it","name":"Mattia Muraro"},"message":"Add observability middleware and endpoint conventions\n\nIntroduce RequestObservabilityMiddleware for logging and tracing, and enhance UserScopeMiddleware with user activity tags. Add endpoint conventions for auth request size limits and no-store headers. Centralize idempotency key handling and month query parsing via shared helpers. Register health check endpoints. Add error message for large payloads and expand test coverage to enforce new patterns. Clean up and improve code consistency.","tree":{"sha":"c7ce2c53d23ff54b2ad460bf10b3c72b76e128b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/trees/c7ce2c53d23ff54b2ad460bf10b3c72b76e128b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/commits/97db665b667d02d525758db27fc595b22846e712","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90131084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro","id":90131084,"login":"mattiamuraro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMTMxMDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro",