.muraro@beta80group.it","name":"Mattia Muraro"},"message":"Refactor to use Dto suffix for all API data objects\n\nReplaces Row/entity classes with Dto-suffixed classes for API responses and handler results across Auth, Payments, Incomes, Forecast Expenses, Forecast Incomes, and Payment Categories. Updates handler interfaces, endpoints, mapping helpers, and tests to use new Dto types. Renames and relocates ForecastExpenseOccurencesQuery and ForecastIncomeOccurencesQuery to ForecastExpenseOccurrencesQuery and ForecastIncomeOccurrencesQuery.","tree":{"sha":"b8484a40b2d9df42e0c404b2138ebc4a37689d35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/trees/b8484a40b2d9df42e0c404b2138ebc4a37689d35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/commits/383ae2c5b4d374d981c5b455fe224910e0d964fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90131084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro","id":90131084,"login":"mattiamuraro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMTMxMDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/commit