Exception, EntityNotFoundException, ConflictException) in API and business logic\n- Rewrite GlobalExceptionHandlingMiddleware to return RFC 7807 Problem Details and ValidationProblemDetails\n- Update all endpoints to use .ProducesProblem(...) for OpenAPI docs\n- Remove ErrorResponse class and related tests\n- Add ErrorCodes and ErrorMessageResources for centralized, localizable error codes/messages\n- Update tests to expect new exception types and messages\n- Improve logging and cancellation handling in handlers and background services\n- Enhance ForecastOccurrenceReconciliationService with exponential backoff and jitter on failures\n- Miscellaneous code cleanups and async/EF Core improvements","tree":{"sha":"9189a069e69f92dccc51bd6091fdc4e939752390","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/trees/9189a069e69f92dccc51bd6091fdc4e939752390"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/commits/3584d83ccd9f6864be002132a5e0e8d0957169fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90131084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro","id":90131084,"login":"mattiamuraro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMTMxMDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/commit/3584d83ccd9f6864be002132a5e0e8d0957169fd","node_id":"C_kwDORzGDHNoAKDM1ODRkODNjY2Q5ZjY4NjRiZTAwMjEzMmE1ZTBlOGQwOTU3MTY5ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/commit/a798136c9391378e09117baf9b116462397bc406","sha":"a798136c9391378e09117baf9b116462397bc406","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/commits/a798136c9391378e09117baf9b116462397bc406"}],"sha":"3584d83ccd9f6864be002132a5e0e8d0957169fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/commits/3584d83ccd9f6864be002132a5e0e8d0957169fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90131084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro","id":90131084,"login":"mattiamuraro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMTMxMDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/commits/a798136c9391378e09117baf9b116462397bc406/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T20:57:14Z","email":"mattia.muraro@beta80group.it","name":"Mattia Muraro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T20:57:14Z","email":"mattia.muraro@beta80group.it","name":"Mattia Muraro"},"message":"Refactor to VSA: DI handlers, logging, middleware cleanup\n\n- Refactor all business logic handlers to use IHandler interfaces and constructor injection, following Vertical Slice Architecture\n- Register handlers in DI with LoggingHandlerDecorator for structured operation logging\n- Remove custom RequestResponseLoggingMiddleware in favor of ASP.NET Core HttpLogging\n- Add UserScopeMiddleware to enrich logs with UserId/Username\n- Refactor CorrelationIdMiddleware to use LoggerMessage and enrich log scope only\n- Update GlobalExceptionHandlingMiddleware to use LoggerMessage\n- Update DI registration to use AddHandlerWithLogging helpers\n- Reorder middleware pipeline for best practices\n- Update logging config for granular log levels (HttpLogging, EF Core)\n- Clean up code, improve naming, and remove redundant comments","tree":{"sha":"5de28e4fec5e402181488510351e1ed6ab418bd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/trees/5de28e4fec5e402181488510351e1ed6ab418bd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/commits/a798136c9391378e09117baf9b116462397bc406","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90131084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro","id":90131084,"login":"mattiamuraro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMTMxMDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/received_events","repos_url":