omes can now be linked to forecast occurrences, with logic for confirming, reopening, or skipping occurrences on create/delete. Frontend displays pending forecast expenses/incomes alongside actual records, with UI to use or discard them. Adds reusable confirmation dialog component. Forecast definitions for expenses now require a category. Includes model, validation, and UI/UX improvements, plus project guideline documentation.","tree":{"sha":"8fa685adf526da83b01c70f8357da88a009b213a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/trees/8fa685adf526da83b01c70f8357da88a009b213a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/commits/a5f34d5a5e8652629806b657b74c0842a61fd608","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90131084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro","id":90131084,"login":"mattiamuraro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMTMxMDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/commit/a5f34d5a5e8652629806b657b74c0842a61fd608","node_id":"C_kwDORzGDHNoAKGE1ZjM0ZDVhNWU4NjUyNjI5ODA2YjY1N2I3NGMwODQyYT