0group.it","name":"Mattia Muraro"},"message":"Add admin UI for managing payment categories\n\nIntroduces an Admin Categories page with full CRUD functionality for payment categories. Adds a new component and route for category management, updates navigation, and extends the API service and models to support category creation, editing, and deletion. Integrates category management state and logic into the main app component.","tree":{"sha":"eb91ff1ab8bfc9ec513ff23ac937fdc098eee2df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/trees/eb91ff1ab8bfc9ec513ff23ac937fdc098eee2df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/commits/22d3646267b0b66ba653c24ae0f710eb892afc46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90131084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro","id":90131084,"login":"mattiamuraro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMTMxMDg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/commit/22d3646267b0b66ba653c24ae0f710eb892afc46","node_id":"C_kwDORzGDHNoAKDIyZDM2NDYyNjdiMGI2NmJhNjUzYzI0YWUwZjcxMGViODkyYW