o/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/commits/2e3ecd1cc1ef3a026427dda5df96d7ba2176d0c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T18:53:01Z","email":"mattia.muraro@beta80group.it","name":"Mattia Muraro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T18:53:01Z","email":"mattia.muraro@beta80group.it","name":"Mattia Muraro"},"message":"Refactor forecast recurrence to support multiple types\n\nMajor overhaul of forecast recurrence logic:\n- Introduced ForecastRecurrenceRuleType entity/table (One Time, Day, Week, Month, Year) with seed data.\n- ForecastExpense/ForecastIncome now reference recurrence type and interval, not ForecastRecurrenceRule.\n- Updated all business logic, API endpoints, and DTOs to use recurrence types.\n- Added GET /api/v1/forecasts/recurrence-rule-types endpoint.\n- Angular: forecast form now selects recurrence type; UI and API updated accordingly.\n- Added/updated migrations and seed logic for new recurrence types.\n- Removed obsolete ForecastRecurrenceRule class and related code.\n- Updated all related backend and frontend tests.","tree":{"sha":"12a19bf2b1ed8a8fe19cd3bdf781fde77e4311f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/trees/12a19bf2b1ed8a8fe19cd3bdf781fde77e4311f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattiamuraro/money-tracker/git/commits/2e3ecd1cc1ef3a026427dda5df96d7ba2176d0c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90131084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattiamuraro/f