":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antalbalint97/scoutbound_agent/commits/8411f246024189c3c2e6892721f2a26334c975f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T17:01:29Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T17:01:29Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat(api): improve TinyFish execution time via parallelization and capping\n\nModified `apps/api/src/orchestrators/discoveryRun.ts` to:\n- Add a configurable candidate inspection cap (`TINYFISH_MAX_COMPANIES_TO_INSPECT`, default 5).\n- Increase the default inspection concurrency to 4 (`TINYFISH_INSPECTION_CONCURRENCY`).\n- Add console logging for these configuration values once per session.\n- Apply the candidate cap by slicing discovery candidates immediately after directory discovery.\n\nAdded `tests/smoke/parallelization.smoke.test.ts` to verify:\n- The `TINYFISH_MAX_COMPANIES_TO_INSPECT` cap is correctly applied.\n- The `TINYFISH_INSPECTION_CONCURRENCY` limit is respected during polling batches.\n\nThese changes reduce the wall-clock execution time for sourcing sessions with large candidate pools while maintaining the existing async-per-candidate architecture.\n\nCo-authored-by: antalbalint97 <63101184+antalbalint97@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"81188d475fd1767c6670a96772dbdf3c133ed622","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antalbalint97/scoutbound_agent/git/trees/81188d475fd1767c6670a96772dbdf3c133ed622"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antalbalint97/scoutbound_agent/git/commits/8411f246024189c3c2e6892721f2a26334c975f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antalbalint97/scoutbound_agent/commit/8411f246024189c3c2e6892721f2a26334c975f0","node_id":"C_kwDORzPlANoAKDg0MTFmMjQ2MDI0MTg5YzNjMmU2ODkyNzIxZjJhMjYzMzRjOTc1ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/antalbalint97/scoutbound_agent/commit/844568a007d761715624827cd9e332cbd47683b2","sha":"844568a007d761715624827cd9e332cbd47683b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antalbalint97/scoutbound_agent/commits/84456