moore"},"message":"feat: Story 5 — Electron shell with in-process Fastify, window management\n\nElectron main process: startServer() integration, single-instance lock,\nwindow state persistence via electron-window-state, display guard,\nno-flash startup (show-when-ready), preload with 7 contextBridge methods,\nIPC quit flow wiring, file-handler with pending path queue.\nSecurity: contextIsolation, sandbox, no nodeIntegration, 6-channel IPC.\n8 new Electron tests (main + window).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2725291c877c45ecd829a0e73b9ca721e416048b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/liminal-ai/mdv/git/trees/2725291c877c45ecd829a0e73b9ca721e416048b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/liminal-ai/mdv/git/commits/9319bb7d9467c6ee12346ad9e830520d4345bad3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80419529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leegmoore","id":80419529,"login":"leegmoore","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNDE5NTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/liminal-ai/mdv/commit/9319bb7d9467c6ee12346ad9e830520d4345bad3","node_id":"C_kwDORza1mNoAKDkzMT