"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leegmoore","id":80419529,"login":"leegmoore","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNDE5NTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leegmoore","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/liminal-ai/mdv/commits/5e6971b08537abc8e70aab90f76e38db55694f9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T22:39:23Z","email":"lee.g.moore@gmail.com","name":"leegmoore"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T22:39:23Z","email":"lee.g.moore@gmail.com","name":"leegmoore"},"message":"feat: add Epic 3 tech design — Mermaid and Rich Content\n\nTech design for Mermaid diagram rendering, Shiki syntax highlighting,\nand rich table content. Hybrid architecture: Shiki integrates server-side\nas a markdown-it plugin, Mermaid renders client-side via dynamic import\nwith esbuild code splitting.\n\nDocuments:\n- tech-design.md: index, decisions, all 8 Q&A answered\n- tech-design-api.md: Shiki integration, mermaid exclusion, schema extension\n- tech-design-ui.md: Mermaid renderer, theme adaptation, warning lifecycle\n- test-plan.md: mock strategy, fixtures, TC mapping (54/55 TCs), 60 tests\n\nKey decisions:\n- Shiki 4.0.2 dual-theme CSS variables (instant theme switch, no re-render)\n- Mermaid 11.13.0 client-side with securityLevel: ''strict''\n- Dynamic import + code splitting for Mermaid (26KB entry, lazy chunks)\n- Replace-not-append warning lifecycle with stale-write guard\n- Timeout is safety net for stuck promises, not UI-blocking guarantee\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude 