b.com/repos/oluizcarvalho/mfe-playground/commits/0413c4cc23b46f177c405ff22f0679311550da39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-05T04:19:40Z","email":"luizandre.ita@gmail.com","name":"Luiz André Carvalho"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-05T04:25:06Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: add shared auth library with Angular Signals and RxJS Subjects\n\nIntroduce @mfe-playground/auth package demonstrating modern state sharing\nacross micro-frontends using Angular Signals (signal, computed) for reactive\nstate and RxJS Subjects for event streams. The singleton AuthService is\nshared across all federated modules via Native Federation''s shareAll\nsingleton configuration, proving that Angular DI works seamlessly across\nMFE boundaries.\n\n- AuthService with signal-based state (currentUser, token, isLoading, isAuthenticated)\n- Computed signals for derived state (userDisplayName, isAdmin)\n- RxJS Subject/BehaviorSubject for auth events stream\n- Mock auth with simulated API delay and token auto-refresh\n- Bridge to existing BroadcastChannel shared state system\n- Host: login/logout form in sidebar, auth events in dashboard\n- remote-angular: auth status badge indicator\n- remote-forms: account section with user info and logout\n- remote-charts: auth events counter card with live metrics\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_018wWBxpUCdBNSX7QhF4Cmo3","tree":{"sha":"5808fafde9eaf751acc4a66a70572ecdb652d179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oluizcarvalho/mfe-playground/git/trees/5808fafde9eaf751acc4a66a70572ecdb652d179"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oluizcarvalho/mfe-playground/git/commits/0413c4cc23b46f177c405ff22f0679311550da39","verification":{"payload":"tree 5808fafde9eaf751acc4a66a70572ecdb652d179\nparent 633241bb524377bf30cc01dacc7559680f3e3e6b\nauthor Luiz André Carvalho <luizandre.ita@gmail.com> 1775362780 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1775363106 +0000\n\nfeat: add shared auth library with Angular Signals and RxJS Subjects\n\nIntroduce @mfe-playground/auth package demonstrating modern state sharing\nacross micro-frontends using Angular Signals (signal, computed) for reactive\nstate and RxJS Subjects for event streams. The singleton AuthService is\nshared across all federated modules via Native Federation''s shareAll\nsingleton configuration, proving that Angular DI works seamlessly across\nMFE boundaries.\n\n- AuthService with signal-based state (currentUser, token, isLoading, isAuthenticated)\n- Computed signals for derived state (userDisplayName, isAdmin)\n- RxJS Subject/BehaviorSubject for auth events stream\n- Mock auth with simulated API delay and token auto-refresh\n- Bridge to existing BroadcastChannel shared state system\n- Host: login/logout form in sidebar, auth events in dashboard\n- remote-angular: auth status badge indicator\n- remote-forms: account section with user info and logout\n- remote-charts: auth events counter card with live metrics\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_018wWBxpUCdBNSX7QhF4Cmo3\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQI9gZXPg\nX8MvKpTH26Kx6aHkj8+c6aqVW13RPuIeOvDuQzxzOzcG8+64U9m/8k8bfLpKQrRCpfrlfwHbQ43h\nOAk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-05T04:25:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.githu