om/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oluizcarvalho/mfe-playground/commits/ff77358e18060ed753d6f3c8bfb24b564b96421b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T14:42:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T14:42:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: persistent metrics store and shared state across all remotes\n\nRoot causes fixed:\n- SharedState singleton was never initialized (no code imported the shared lib)\n- Metrics were ephemeral (CustomEvents lost on navigation between routes)\n- No real cross-remote interaction (counter was local, state never propagated)\n\nChanges:\n- Host bootstrap initializes global metrics store and SharedState singleton\n- All remotes persist metrics to globalThis.__mfeMetricsStore\n- All remotes have lazy-init SharedState fallback via BroadcastChannel\n- remote-angular shares counter value via SharedState (persists on re-mount)\n- remote-charts loads historical metrics and displays shared counter\n- Dashboard shows full shared context (counter, name, theme, notifications)\n- Metrics panel loads historical data on mount\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LPWsCkaXXMDrPvB13JwyVA","tree":{"sha":"de13acf7fc92be9e9e5b90a6b96cc3ce2b3bcd93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oluizcarvalho/mfe-playground/git/trees/de13acf7fc92be9e9e5b90a6b96cc3ce2b3bcd93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/oluizcarvalho/mfe-playground/git/commits/ff77358e18060ed753d6f3c8bfb24b564b96421b","verification":{"payload":"tree de13acf7fc92be9e9e5b90a6b96cc3ce2b3bcd93\nparent 3982552384745ed646bec54d30b03919367b9f36\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774795377 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774795377 +0000\n\nfix: persistent metrics store and shared state across all remotes\n\nRoot causes fixed:\n- SharedState singleton was never initialized (no code imported the shared lib)\n- Metrics were ephemeral (CustomEvents lost on navigation between routes)\n- No real cross-remote interaction (counter was local, state never propagated)\n\nChanges:\n- Host bootstrap initializes global metrics store and SharedState singleton\n- All remotes persist metrics to globalThis.__mfeMetricsStore\n- All remotes have lazy-init SharedState fallback via BroadcastChannel\n- remote-angular shares counter value via SharedState (persists on re-mount)\n- remote-charts loads historical metrics and displays shared counter\n- Dashboard shows full shared context (counter, name, theme, notifications)\n- Metrics panel loads historical data on mount\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LPWsCkaXXMDrPvB13JwyVA\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIUgHid/\nq4eK0X49+dAga30NoUNc9V5H3Toowz1pX3zd1U1Eu8sZ1T89TS3FetcsJAhXME8wyYEMqiLspe4M\nkQc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-29T14:43:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":